<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Lontomba</book>
  <para style="toc3">Mal</para>
  <para style="toc2">MALAKO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nsango Ndɔti nga bɔkɛtɛki Malako</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nsango Ndɔti nga bɔkɛtɛki</para>
  <para style="mt1">Malako</para>
  <para style="is1">Ebandelo</para>
  <para style="ip">O menkanda mɛnɛi me Nsango Ndɔti enka Yesu, mɔkɛtɛki Malako mole mopenda boube mpe mopenda noyalela.</para>
  <para style="ip">O mɛlɔngɔ me boho, Malako aɛnia Yesu lo «Ngana onka Nyambe» (1, 1). Ya motu molobo mwemonya, lendaka moimenyama mbala nzike o Nsango Ndɔti enkuma (1, 11; 9, 7; lenda mpe 3, 11; 5, 7), ɛbɔtɔ nobomama kwokwo nyaima nsa o mpoha enka Yesu (Lenda mpe 3, 12; 5, 43; 7, 24; 8, 30; 9, 30). Itina be? Na itina ɛɔhɔ nɔhwama nko na nyambeli Oiko owakaki o ekulusu, lolenge lwambaki nkumu enka bamani monkama.</para>
  <para style="ip">O lolenge loiko, Yoane Moini abataki lotomo nɔkɔlɔngɔnia bato banka Nyambe (1, 2-8). Ele na boili nde Yesu mpe ainamaki (1, 9-11).</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesu amekamaki o bokaika (1, 12-13). O mbiha, aobanda nwɛnia polele ntomo inande o iyɔngɔ i bato. Aiko Malako aɛnia na ipeta mbala nzike bonkumu bonka Yesu, o elaka elakaka nde mampinga na mpe ebikiaka nde bakɔni (1, 14; 8, 30).</para>
  <para style="ip">O eteni eipe enka nkɛti inande, Malako aɛnia lolenge lohaka Yesu o mɛnyɔkɔ, na iwa mpe na makundwelo mamolila o Yelusalema (8, 31; 10, 52). Alwebia onka baekoli banande mbala ihato, ya tabaɔhɔlɔ. Ambotepelake penda na boili nde mɔmɛnɛ noyahɔlɔ lo «Ngana onka Moto», ya liko ibombi ilingola bomoto bonande ile na ilɔkɔ bɔnɛnɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">O Yelusalema, Yesu ɔtwaki na loumu, aɔbɛlia batɛki o itumba i Nyambe mpe baoyakekia na bakɛndii ba Isalaɛlɛ. Onka nde eliki epohe e ilako i mbiha onka malanga manande, onka impinga, mpe onka baekoli banande (ikapo 11-13).</para>
  <para style="ip">Makapo ma 14-15 mabuliama o maina mape ma mbiha manka Yesu. Ele ɔkɔ ongwɛnɛne nkɛti i mbiha i elambo ɛlɛ nde na banande (nkapola mputa na balɔkɔ impa na vinyo), lobondela lonande kaika o itia i getesemani, ikamba inande, mbakema enande o ekulusu, mpe nkundami enande. Lendaka o mbiha e iwa inande, bainto baotana iyita inande boponga mpe baoywamba mbɔ aokundwa o iwa ale na bɔmɔi (16, 1-8). Bayabombaki lo baeywa (nkɛti inkina ihangia mbɔ inkina itepela na boube nyɛniami enka Yesu ekundwaki mpe nziyeyami e nande; nkɛti ilɔkɔ iyɛniama o nenge inkuma o menkanda menkina).</para>
  <para style="ip">O mbiha e ntangi Nsango Ndɔti nga bɔkɛtɛki Malako, bongweba na inyo lo ɔmɔ o bakɛndii banka Loma, mbɔ Yesu e mohi Nazaleta «aliki hɔlɔ Ngana onka Nyambe» (15, 39)?</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ilako inka Yoane Moini</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3, 1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoa 1, 19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">1, 1 </char>
    </note>Ibando i Nsango Ndɔti enka Yesu Kilito, Ngana onka Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Boiko lɔkɛtɛmɛ bɔnɛ o buku enka nteti Isaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">«Nangotinda motwantomo momi o boho bɔwɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">nokolondela mboka.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Iyoi imɔ itotwa o bohobe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">Bolonda mboka enka Nkolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">bomotandiele mianzo tɔi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mlki 3.1; Isay 40.3.</char></note>!»<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Yoane Moini aɛnɛnɛki o bohobe; alalolaki boinami bo mbutoli meloko na boili bwabinyi bɔ nsɔpi. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Ebumu enkuma e Yudeya mpe bakihi ba Yelusalema bahaka onka nde; bainamaka na nde o Yaladɛnɛ na nyimenyi nsɔpi i balɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yoane alɔtɔkɔ mpoho i nyama lina kamela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kamela: ele nyama ehunga bato nobeba maumba</char></note> na monsenge mo mpoho i nyama o ikɔngɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda 2 Bank 1.8.</char></note>; alɛkɛkɛ biɛnzuka mpe na mpako i lia. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Alalolaki: «Oiko oye o mbiha e mi ampenda na nguya; mpe timbe mbɔbɔtɔ nokutama noutola mehinga me bikoto binande. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Mi naoboina na mai, ya nde, angoboina na Molimo mɔ Pɛtɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Boinami mpe menkami enka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Mat 3, 13-4, 11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3, 21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4, 1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Lendaka, o maina malɔkɔ, Yesu aimaki o Nazaleta e Galilaya mpe ainamaki na Yoane o Yaladɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Ohapwaki nde o mai, aoywɛnɛ liko iolipwa mpe Molimo mɔ Pɛtɔ mosulwa onka nde lo emenga. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Mpe iyoi nyaima o Lobola: «Wɛ ole Ngana omi o lolango; nabulwa ba na wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Nye 2.7; Isay 42.1.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Nko o elaka eiko, Molimo mokamanyaki Yesu noha o bohobe. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Maina ntuku inɛi na mokoka Yesu alengwamaki na Satana. Aliki mputa na nyama i malia mpe mentomwa menka Nyambe memotielaki.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aobeya balubi ba nsi banɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mat 4, 12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4, 14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5, 1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />O mbiha enka Yoane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda 6.17.</char></note> nokapema, Yesu ahaki o Galilaya; alalolaki Nsango Ndɔti enka Nyambe mpe atepelaki bɔnɛ: <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />«Elaka eokoka, mpe Bonkumu bonka Nyambe boya bɛlɛbɛlɛ! Bwenza meloko mpe bwamba Nsango Ndɔti!»<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Nga bɔkɛndɛkɛ Yesu o ntundu e ibeke i ebale e Galilaya, aɛnɛki Simona na Andele e mohikɔlɔ onande, baboka boluba o ebale, baliki balubi. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu abaebiaki ndɛmbɔ: «Bonziele mpe nangoboyalia balubi ba bato.» <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Nko o elaka ɛlɔkɔ, bakambiaki maluba ma balɔkɔ, bamoiyelaki. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Yesu akɛndɛki ngano lopwa, aɛnɛki Zake na mohikɔlɔ o nande Yoane, bana banka Zebedai, baliki o bwato nolonda maluba ma balɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Nko o elaka ɛlɔkɔ ababeyaki; mpe bakambiaki ihe e balɔkɔ Zebedai na basali o bwato, bamoiyelaki.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aobikia moto otungiamaki na molimo mo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4, 31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesu na baekoli banande bahaki o Kapalanauma. Mpe o boina bo sabala, aɔtwaki o itumba i lobondela inka Bayuda mpe alakaki. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Malako manande mabaɔtɛlɛki o meloko, na itina abalaka lo moto ole na bonkumu ya lo balaki ba mokeko pɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Lendaka, mpiko o itumba i lobondela inka Bayuda, eliki na moto ɔmɔ otungiamaki na molimo mo bompunda. Atotwaki: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 24 </char></note>«Ondi be na iho, Yesu e mohi Nazaleta? Oya nɔtɔhɛkɛyɛ? Naeba bole wɛ: Mɔpɛtwami monka Nyambe!» <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yesu amwamaki mpe aomohangela: «Kiha nyɛ bɛlɛ onka moto ɔnɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Molimo mo bompunda mo mopukuhaki na nguya mpe mɔbɛlɛki onka nde ntotwa na nguya ependa. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Balɔkɔ bankuma baemwaki noyaubola balɔkɔ na balɔkɔ: «Lɔnɛ lwebia be? Lenda ilako i itɛmu ntondiama na bonkumu! Apa lotomo nsa onka melimo me bompunda mpe memona!» <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Mpe loumu lonka Yesu lwanzwaki o elaka ɛlɔkɔ o ebumu enkuma e Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aobikia boike bo bato ba makɔni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8, 14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4, 38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Nko o elaka eiko ɛbɛlɛki balɔkɔ o itumba i mondela inka Bayuda, Yesu ahaki nde na Zake na Yoane o itumba inka Simona na Andele <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Lendaka, nyango e bokilo enka Simona abetamaki nkukama o ntange na itina aliki na bieta; baebiaki Yesu na ihali na boili nde. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Abɛlɛmɛki na nde, amokataki o lɔbɔkɔ mpe amɔtɛliaki. Bieta bihilaki mpe abandaki nobapa bindei.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Oiyaki mpokwa, ombiha enka mwane nosulwa, babɛkɛlɛki Yesu bakoni bankuma mpe na batungiamaki na melimo me mebe. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Boiko, inanga inkuma bakokanaki o boho bo moiho. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Yesu abikiaki boike bo bakɔni batungiamaki na male ma lolenge lonkuma mpe abɛliaki boike bo melimo me mebe. Tamepa epohe notepela, na itina memwebaki.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 1:34">Yesu akumbolaki o Galilaya</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:34">(Lenda mpe Luk 4, 42-44)<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Na mpendu e melonge, Yesu atɛlɛmɛki, abɛlɛki mpe ahaki o bohobe mpiko, abondelaki. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simona na bakɛndɛki nande bahaki nomokomba; <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />omotanaki balɔkɔ, baomwebia bɔnɛ: «Bato bankuma bakokomba.» <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Ya Yesu aobaebia: «Totu mbiha enkina, o bihe bile bɛlɛbɛlɛ olongi naisie nolalola Nsango Ndɔti, naitina oiko ele lobo lomboye mi.» <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Na boiko, akumbolaki o Galilaya enkuma; alalolaki o matumba ma balɔkɔ ma mondela mpe abɛliaki melimo me mebe.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aɔpɛtɔlɔ moto ɔ mɛliɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8, 1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5, 12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Moto ɔmɔ ɔ mɛliɔ amɔbɛlɛmɛnɛki, aɔmɔbɔndɔ mpe aokuki makulubɔngɔ ntepela bɔnɛ: «Kaki olondi, ɔhɔ nɔmpɛtɔlɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesu amokelaki molika; ahembolaki lɔbɔkɔ, amokataki ntepela bɔnɛ: «Nalondi, pɛtwamema!» <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Nko o elaka ɛlɔkɔ, mɛliɔ memohilaki mpe apɛtwamaki. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Boiko, Yesu amokokomiaki mpe na ihali amoisenyaki. <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />Mpe aomwebia ndɛmbɔ: «Oyabakaka noyala nkwebia nsa moto ɔmɔ. Ya nsɔ noyaɛnia onka nkanga enka Nyambe mpe paa ikapo na boili mpɛtwami ɛwɛ nga bohangaki Mɔsɛ, mpiko bangobata motato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Lew 14.2-32.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Ya ohaki nde, aobanda nolalola nsango. Ekelaki mbɔ Yesu ayale nkɔtwa polele o inanga; ya aliki nko o nanda e inanga o manda ipa bato. Mpe bato baimaki mbiha na mbiha noya onka nde.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aobikia mokatatali</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5, 17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Ombia e ngano maina, Yesu asiaki o Kapalanauma mpe bambaki mbɔ aliki o itumba. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Mpe boike bo bato bakokanaki aiko teisia noyala na manda, nsa na o boho bo moiho mo itumba. Mpe abalakaki Mbo i Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Ngano bato bayakaki, bamɔbɛkɛlɛki mokatatali moliki mbebeba na bato banɛi. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Mpe nga bopa balɔkɔ tabaɔhɔ nomoiyia ole nde na boili impinga i bato, batubaki mwanza onga na manda eliki Yesu, bamosuloyaki na itɔkɔ ibetamaki nde. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Ɔɛnɛki nde bwambi bo balɔkɔ, Yesu aoyebia mokatatali: «Ngana omi, nsɔpi iwɛ iohabinyama.» <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Ngano balaki ba mokeko bakihaki aiko, bakanenaki o meloko me balɔkɔ bɔnɛ: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />«Moto ɔnɛ atepela boiko itina be? Anyaka Nyambe. Ɔhɔ nohabinya nsɔpi noni bopa Nyambe mɔmɛnɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Nko o elaka ɛlɔkɔ, Yesu aɔhɔlɔki nyaima o molimo mo nande bikaneno bi balɔkɔ mpe aobaebia ndɛmbɔ: «Bole na bikaneno bi lolenge loiko o meloko me nyainyo itina be? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Ele liale nwebia mokatatali mbɔ: “Nsɔpi i wɛ iohabinyama”, na mpe nohanga mbɔ: “Tɛlɛmɛ, pwa itɔkɔ iwɛ mpe nsɔ”? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Ya bwebe mbɔ: Ngana onka bobato ale na bonkumu nohabinya nsɔpi o nse.» Boiko atepelaki onka mokatatali: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />«Nakwebia, tɛlɛmɛ, pwa itɔkɔ iwɛ mpe nsɔ o itumba iwɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Moto oiko atɛlɛmɛki, apwaki itɔkɔ inande na ihali mpe abɛlɛki o boho bonka bato bankuma. Balɔkɔ bankuma bakakatanaki mpe baumiaki Nyambe ntepela mbɔ: «Tatwɛnɛni nsa na lopwa mpamba lolenge lɔnɛ!»<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aobeya Lewi</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9, 9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5, 27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu aisiaki noha o ntundu e ibeke i ebale. Impinga i bato inkuma imɔkɛndɛlɛki mpe abalakaki. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Olekaki nde, aɛnɛki Lewi, ngana onka Alupayo, akihi o itumba i nzuti mputi. Amwebiaki bɔnɛ: «Onziele!» Lewi atɛlɛmɛki mpe amoiyelaki. <verse eid="MRK 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Yesu asiaki nɔlɛ o mesa o itumba inka Lewi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Luk 5.29.</char></note>. Boike bo bautii ba mputi mpe na bato ba nsɔpi baliki o mesa mputa na Yesu mpe na baekoli banande, naitina baliki boike nomoiyelake. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Mpe balaki ba mokeko baliki o etuluku ɛmɔ na Bapalusi ɛnɛkɛ mbɔ Yesu alɛ mputa na bato ba nsɔpi mpe bautii ba mputi, baubolaki baekoli banande: «Be? Alɛkɛke mputa na bautii ba mputi mpe na bato ba nsɔpi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na mɔlɔngɔ 15-16 na Luka 15.1-2.</char></note>?» <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu okaka boiko abaebiaki bɔnɛ: «Bato bale na bionge bokembu bapokombake nkanga ya baiko bakɔnɔ. Tiya nokombake baɛlɛmi ya bato ba nsɔpi.»<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilako inka Yesu na boili mohipili</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9, 14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5, 33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Lendaka, baekoli banka Yoane na Bapalusi bakilaka. Boiko, bato baoyoye noubola Yesu bɔnɛ: «Baekoli banka Yoane na banka Bapalusi bakilake, ya bawɛ bapokile itina be?» <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu ababekwelaki ndɛmbɔ: «Bokanena mbɔ babeyami ba ntɛkɔ e ibala baɔhɔ nokila aiko ole balɔkɔ mputa na boome? O elaka eiko ele balɔkɔ mputa nande bapɔhe nokila. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Ya elaka engoya engoiyeyame boome; na boiko, bangokila boina boiko.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />«Tembe na moto ɔho nobamba etobo ɛtɛkɛ na etobo ɛ ntɛmu; kaki mpamba, ɛntɛmu engwatola ɛnɛ ɛtɛkɛ, mpe eatwela engopula. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Tembe na moto ɔhɔ nwangola vinyo ɛ ntɛmu o bikutu bi kala bikelama na mpoho i nyama; kaki mpamba, vinyo engwatola bikutu bilɔkɔ: Aiko na vinyo na bikutu bingopitana. Ya vinyo ɛ ntɛmu, o bikutu bi bitɛmu.»<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu mpe boina bo sabala</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6, 1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">2, 23 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda mpe Dut 23.26. </char>
    </note>Lendaka o boina bɔmɔ bo sabala, Yesu alekaki o matia ma mambo i bule. Mpe baekoli banande bahaki nonyukake mpongo mboka mboka. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Na boiko, Bapalusi bamoubolaki: «Lendaka, itina be baekoli bawɛ bakela lipopae mokeko moyaiho epohe nokelama o boina bo sabala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Mab 34.21.</char></note>?» <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Mpe Yesu ababekwelaki bɔnɛ: «Tabotanga lokelaki Dawidi o elaka eliki nde na bohenga, mpe okaki nde nzala nde na bakɛndɛki na nde? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Ngamo ngamo o elaka enka nkanga ɛnɛnɛ enka Nyambe ɛmɔ e lina Abiatala, aɔtwaki o itumba i Nyambe, aɔlɛ mampa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Sam 15.35. Lenda Lew 249.</char></note> ma ikapo mapɔbɔte moto nsa na ɔmɔ nɔlɛ, umonya nko bankanga banka Nyambe, aomapa mpe onka baliki nande.» <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Mpe Yesu aobaebiaki: «Sabala ekelamaki na itina inka moto, ya moto takelama na itina inka sabala. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Ɛlɔkɔ eiko Ngana onka bobato ale mpe Nkolo enka sabala.»<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aobikia moto o boina bo sabala</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12, 9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6, 6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Na mbiha, Yesu aisiaki nɔtwa o itumba i lobondela inka Bayuda. Mpiko eliki na moto ɔmɔ okakatala lɔbɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Bamɔngɔmiaki nolenda na mpe aɔhɔ nomobikia o boina bo sabala, naitina bakombaki nɔmɔhɛngɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu aebiaki moto oiko okatatala lɔbɔkɔ bɔnɛ: «Tɛlɛmɛ, yaka anɛ o boho bonka bato bankuma.» <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Mpe aobaubola: «Mokeko mohanga be na boili sabala? Nokela bobe na mpe nokela bɔlɔti? Nobikia moto na mpe nomoboma?» Ya balɔkɔ bakihaki nyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesu akɛndiaki maiho nobalenda na lɔbɛli, aliki na bobe na boili meloko bolo me balɔkɔ. Aohangela moto oiko: «Hembola lɔbɔkɔ.» Alohembolaki mpe lɔbɔkɔ lobɔtɔki. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Ɔbɛlɛki Bapalusi, baohaka nkuku mputa na bato banka Elode nokomba lolenge lɔhɔ nde nobomama.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Impinga i bato ioya ole Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu ayahɔlɔlɔki mputa na baekoli banande noha o ntundu e ibeke i ebale. Impinga i bato i inɛnɛ nyaima o Galilaya imoiyelaki. Mpe na i Yudea, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />i Yelusalema, o mokokolo mo i Idume, mokokolo mole o nsɛmboka e Yaladɛnɛ, o mokonda mo Tile mpe Sidona, impinga i bato inɛnɛ iyakaki ole Yesu na itina bambaki likelaki nde. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Na boiko, Yesu atindaki baekoli banande mbɔ balonde bwato bɔmɔ itina inande nolota impinga taiyomobaha. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Nga bobikiaki nde bato boike, ɛlɔkɔ eiko banɛ batungiamaki na makɔni babengelaki nomokata. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Ɔmwɛnɛki melimo me bompunda, bayabokaki o makaka manande mpe batotwaki: «Wɛ ole Ngana onka Nyambe!» <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Mpe Yesu abapaki lotomo noyala nkwebia bole nde.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aɔhɔlɔ mentomwa menande liomu na bape</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10, 1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6, 12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Yesu aoyoiyela o monkondo; mpe aobeya baiko baondaki nde mpe baomɔkɛndɛle. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />O iyɔngɔ i balɔkɔ, ahɔlɔki liomu na bape babeyaki nde mentomwa menande noyala mputa nande mpe nolalolake Nsango Ndɔti, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />na nguya ɛmbɛli melimo me mebe. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Lenda maina manka baekoli liomu na bape batɛliaki nde: Simona etikaki Yesu lina Petelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Mat 16.16-18; Yoa 1.42.</char></note>, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Zake, ngana onka Zebedai na Yoane, e mɔhikɔlɔ onka Zake mpe Yesu abatikaki lina Bwanɛlɛgɛsɛ, nimbo mbɔ «bato baɛlɛmɛ na bilunza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Luka 9.54.</char></note>», <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andele, Pilipo, Batelemi, Matayo, Toma, Zake ngana onka Alipaya, Tadeyo mpe Simona, mobuni mo bɔnsɔmi bonka ebumu, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />mpe Yudasi Isikaliɔtɛ, oiko ohɛngɛki Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na bokundu bonande</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Yesu aisiaki o itumba. Mpe impinga isiaki nokokana o lolenge lole mbɔ tabasia nobata nsa epohe nɔlɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Na boili nsango ɛlɔkɔ, bokundu bonande bayakaki nomopwa, na itina batepelaki mbɔ: «Motu monande moinda bɔlɔti!»<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abekola onka bahɛngi</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mat 12, 22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11, 14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12, 10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Mpe balaki ba mokeko basulwaki o Yelusalema batepelaki: «Ale na Bɛlɛzɛbule<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bɛlɛzɛbule: lenda Mat 10.25 mpe nkɛti ile o nse.</char></note> o iyɔngɔ i nande!» Na mpe: «Ele na boili nkumu enka melimo me mebe omopa nguya nɔmɛbɛlia!» <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Na boiko, Yesu ababeyaki mpe abahɛkwelaki o bikolongo: «Lolenge be Satana aɔhɔ nɔbɛlia Satana? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Kaki bonkumu bɔmɔ bokapwa, bonkumu bɔlɔkɔ tabongoisia nohilama; <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Kaki bokundu bɔmɔ bokapwa o iyɔngɔ i bɔlɔkɔ, bɔpɔhe noisia nohilama. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Mpe kaki Satana ayatakamena nde mɔmɛnɛ, tangoisia nohilama mpe lonande lohila.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />«Moto apohe nɔtɛlɛ o itumba inka moto o nguya mpe nopunza biomba binande, kaki nani tamondoli mehinga, tangɔhɔ nopunza itumba inande. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Na iliɔlɔ, nabwebia mbɔ, nsɔpi inkuma inka bato mpe na menyakatano me balɔkɔ onga na Nyambe bingohabinyama. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Ya kaki moto nonyaka Molimo mɔ Pɛtɔ apohe nohabinyama bɔbɛlɛ na bɔbɛlɛ, moto ɔlɔkɔ auliama na boili nsɔpi bɔbɛlɛ na bɔbɛlɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu abaebiaki boiko na itina balɔkɔ batepelaki mbɔ: «Ale na molimo mo bompunda.»<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyango na bahikɔlɔ banka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12, 46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8, 19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Nyango enka Yesu na bahikɔlɔ banande baoyoye; baliki o nanda mpe bamobeyaki. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Impinga imolingolaki mpe baomwebia: «Lenda, nyango ɛwɛ na bahikɔlɔ bawɛ ba mele na bahikɔlɔ bawɛ ba bainto bale o nanda mpe bakokomba.» <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesu aobaisenye: «Nyango emi na bahikɔlɔ bami banɔni?» <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Mpe aokɛndia maiho nolenda baiko bamolingolaki ikumba mpe aobaebia: «Lenda nyango emi na bahikɔlɔ bami. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Oiko okela mwano monka Nyambe ale mohikɔlɔ omi, nkana emi mpe nyango emi.»<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ekolongo enka mobweyi</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13, 1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8, 4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yesu aisiaki nolaka o ntundu e ibeke i ebale. Impinga i bato ikokanaki bɛlɛbɛlɛ nande, na boili boike bo bato aokondela o bwato bɔmo mpe aokihi. Impinga inkuma i bato iliki o mokonda ntakatolo na mai. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Abalakaki mbo boike o bikolongo mpe o ilako inande aobaebia bɔnɛ: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />«Bolangola! Boina bɔmɔ, mobweyi ɔmɔ abɛlɛki nobweyake. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Lendaka, obweyaki nde, ngano maopo maokita o ntundu e mboka: mpulu ioyoye mpe iɔlɛ mankuma. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Mamɔ makitaki o manda e mabɔkɔ epa lɔbɔmbi taloyala loike. Na ihali, mapundwaki itina lɔbɔmbi taloyala na mpipa. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />O elaka ebalaki mwane mpe, na boili mekanga tameyale meike maomaki. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Mamɔ mpe makitaki ɔ nsɛndɛ. Nsɛndɛ ioywanga mpe ioyikimia miɔbɔlɔ, mpe tamɛtɔ mambo. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Mamɔ maopo makitaki o lɔbɔmbi lo bɔmpou; maopundwa mpe maoyoula, maɔtɔ mpongo: imɔ iɔbɛlia mambo ntuku ihato, inkina ntuku motoba mpe imɔ monkama.» <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Mpe Yesu atepelaki nɛmbɔ: «Oiko ole na matoi manzoki, aoke!»<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Itina be Yesu ahɛkɔlɔki o bikolongo</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13, 10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8, 9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Oliki Yesu nde kaika o manda, bato bamolingolaki mputa na baekoli liomu na bape baomoubola na boili bikolongo. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Yesu aobabekwela bɔnɛ: «Na boili inyo, inɛ ibombi i Bonkumu bonka Nyambe ibopaemena; ya onka baiko bale o nanda, inkuma ioyokana lo bikolongo, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />olongi mbɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">“nsa balenda, bapwɛne</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">mpe nsa baoka, bapɔhɔle</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">ntiki tabaenza meloko mpe tabaohabinyama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isay 6.9-10.</char></note>!”»<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aolimbola ekolongo enka mobweyi</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13, 18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8, 11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Mpe Yesu aobaebia: «Bɔpɔhɔle ekolongo ɛnɛ? Na boiko bɔngɔhɔlɔ bikolongo binkuma bolobe? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Mobweyi abweya Ilako enka Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Lenda bale o ntundu e mboka obweyama Ilako: oka balɔkɔ Ilako, Satana aoyoye nko o elaka ɛlɔkɔ mpe aoyoumonya Ilako imbobweyame onka balɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Nko o lolenge lɔlɔkɔ, lenda baiko baobweyama o manda i mabɔkɔ: balɔkɔ kaki baoka Ilako, baoyoiyamba na ihali na ibulwako. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Ya o iyɔngɔ i balɔkɔ taimbe na mekanga, bale bato ba elaka ɛmɔ. Mpe kaki liale na mɛnyɔkɔ bioya na boili Ilako, baokita o bwambi. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Mamɔ maobweyama ɔ nsɛndɛ: ele baiko baoka Ilako, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />ya mekiɛtɛno me molongo, nengwami e mbati mpe na mpoha inkina imbe ioyɔtwa mpe ioyoikimia Ilako iya na bohenga bo mambo. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Lendaka banɛ bahikamaki o lɔbɔmbi lɔ bɔmpɔu: baiko baoyoka Ilako, baoiyamba mpe iobota mambo, inɛ ntuku ihato, imɔ ntuku motoba mpe inkina monkama.»<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekolongo na boili mbaka</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8, 16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Boiko Yesu abaebiaki bɔnɛ: «Mbaka engoya mbɔ etikame o nse e eboko na mpe o nse e nkengo? Tembe mbɔ etikame o liko i ehatielo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Mat 5.15; Luka 11.33.</char></note>? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Na itina inkuma ibombi ingwɛnɛnɛ polele o boina bo bɔnɛnɛ, mpe inkuma ile o nkuku ingomɛngiama bwe bwe. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Kaki oiko ole na matoi manzoki, aoke!» <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yesu abaebiaki: «Boyabakaka na liko ioka inyo! Ele nko lwɛli lwɛlia inyo, longobwɛlielama mpe longobopaemena penda. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Na itina oiko ole na yomba engomopaemena; ya onka oiko opa tambe na, nsa eiko ele nande engomolamwamema.»<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekolongo na boili boopo bopundwa bɔlɔkɔ kaika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu atepelaki bɔnɛ: «Engoyala nko lolenge loiko o Bonkumu bonka nyambe: Nga lo moto o bweya maopo o lɔbɔmbi. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Aɔnge na mpe ateleme na miane na matio, boopo bongopundwa mpe boyoula, nde tangweba lokelama. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Lɔbɔmbi lɔlɔkɔ lɔmɛnɛ lopundoya: boho ihɔngi, o mbiha mpongo mpe o nsuki mambo i bule ntwatonda na mpongo. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Mpe o elaka ɛngwɛle mambo i bule, ipaka ingopwama na itina elaka e malukelo eiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Yɔɛ 4.13.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekolongo na boili boopo bo mutalade</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13, 31-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13, 18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesu atepelaki: «Tɔhɔ nwɛlia Bonkumu bonka Nyambe na yomba lina be na mpe na ekolongo lina be ɛɔhɔ iho nwɛlia na bonkumu bonka Nyambe? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Ele nko nga lo boopo bo mutalade: kaki bohikama o lɔbɔmbi, boyalake bɔkɛ penda maopo mankuma male o molongo. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Ombiha e mbweyami, bopundwa mpe boyoula nopenda mete menkuma mele o itia. Mpe mɔbɛlia bikɔkɔ bi binɛnɛ biɔhɔ mpulu i liko notonga maumbu o lonse lo ikemba i mɔlɔkɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Na bikolongo biike bi lolenge loiko, Yesu abalakaki Ilako, o lolenge lɔbɔtɔki balɔkɔ nɔmɔhɔlɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Tabaebiaka mbo noyala nkɔtɛyɛ ekolongo; ya kaki ale manda ɛmɔ na baekoli banande, abalimbwelaka inkuma.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aama empumpu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8, 23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8, 22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />O boina boiko na mpokwa, Yesu aohangela baekoli banande: «Topendie nsemboka eni e ibeke i ebale.» <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />O kambiaki balɔkɔ impinga i bato; batombaki Yesu nokondela o bwato boliki nde. Mato mankina mpe maliki aiko. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Mpe empumpu ɛnɛnɛ ekanzwaki, mabombi ma moula mabatandaki mpe bwato botondaki na mai. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Mpe Yesu abetamaki o lombiha lo bwato, motu nsangema o monkili. Baekoli banande bamoumona mpe baototwa bɔnɛ: «Molaki, iho tohaka iwa: lobo loiko lopokwɛne wɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yesu atolomwaki, angwelaki ɛpɛli mpe aohangela mai ma ibeke i ebale: «Yala nyɛ!» Ɛpɛli esulwaki mpe ebale eotanda molenge. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Yesu aobaubola bɔnɛ: «Boka bɔɔmɔ itina be? Tabombe nani na bwambi?» <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Bapendaki noka bɔɔmɔ mpe baoyahangelaki balɔkɔ na balɔkɔ bɔnɛ: «Ale noni ole nsa na bipɛli na bibale bimona<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Nye 65.8; 89.10; 107.23-32.</char></note>?»<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aobikia moto otungiamaki na melimo mebe</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8, 28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8, 26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />O mbiha, baiyaki nsemboka eni enkina e ibeke i ebale, o mokokolo monka Bagelasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Mat 8.28 mpe nkɛti ile o nse.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Ohapwaki Yesu o bwato, moto ɔmɔ otungiamaki na molimo mo bompunda aimaki o maita, ayakaki nko elaka eiko nokumana na nde. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Akihaka o maita mpe moto nsa na ɔmɔ taisia nɔhɔ nomokanga nsa na bwamba; <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />na itina bilaka bike akangemaki na mehinga mpe na maamba, ya atenakaka mehinga meiko na maamba. Nsa na moto ɔmɔ tayala na nguya nomoimba. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Na miane na matio, ambokihake nko o maita mpe o menkondo, nototwaka mpe noyakɛtɛkɛ na mabɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Ɔɛnɛki nde Yesu iteta; na boiko, apuhwaki mpe akukamaki na mabɔngɔ o boho bonande, <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />mpe atotwaki na nguya: «Londi wɛ na mi be, Yesu, Ngana onka Nyambe Ependa Kaa? Nakɔbɔndɔ o lina inkana Nyambe tontungiake!» <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Na itina Yesu amwebiaki mbɔ: «Molimo mo bompunda, bɛlɛ o iyɔngɔ inka moto ɔnɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Yesu amoubolaki bɔnɛ: «Lina iwɛ be?» Amoisenyaki ndɛmbɔ: «Lina imi “Impinga”, na itina tole boike.» <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Mpe amɔbɔndɔki na ipeta noyala nko batinda o mokokolo monkina. <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Lendaka mpiko o lokenge lo monkondo, eliki na botonga bo bɔnɛnɛ bo ngulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lew 11.7 mpe Dut 14.8.</char></note> bombokombake biomba nɔlɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Melimo me bompunda mɛbɔndɔki Yesu ntepela mbɔ: «Ototinde onka ngulu olongi mbɔ tɔtɛle tumbu o ilɔkɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Amepaki epohe. Na boiko, mɛbɛlɛki nɔtɛlɛ o ngulu mpe botonga bokulumwaki noyaboka nyaima o mekilibongo ki o ebale. Eliki bɛlɛbɛlɛ ngulu nkoto ipe ilindaki mpe iowa. <verse eid="MRK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Boiko baibongolaki balotaki mpe batombaki nsango o inanga mpe o ngando. Mpe bato bayakaki nolenda lokelamaki. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Baoyoye bɛlɛbɛlɛ na Yesu mpe baoywɛnɛ moto oiko otungiamaki na molimo mo mobe: akihi, alɔtɔ bitobo mpe ale hilɛ: nde otungiamaki na impinga i melimo me mebe. Mpe baokaki bɔɔmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Baiko baɛnɛki babahɛkwelaki lilekaki onka moto otungiamaka na molimo mo mobe mpe ilekaki onka ngulu. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Boiko baɔbɔndɔ Yesu mbɔ atangwe o mokokolo mo balɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Okondelaki Yesu o bwato, oiko otungiamaka na molimo mo mobe amɔbɔndɔki mbɔ ayale mputa na nde. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Yesu tamopa epohe, ya aomwebia mbɔ: «Nsɔ o itumba iwɛ onka bokundu bɔ wɛ, mpe obahɛkwele liokokelela Nkolo na boili molika monande.» <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Na boiko, moto oiko ahaki mpe abandaki nolalolake o Dekapoli inkuma imokelelaki Yesu; mpe bankuma baemwaki.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngana o ngainto onka Yailo na ngainto okataki etobo enka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9, 18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8, 40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Oisiaki Yesu o bwato nopendia nsemboka eni e ibeke i ebale, impinga i inɛnɛ i bato iputanaki bɛlɛbɛlɛ na nde aiko oliki nde o ibongo. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Ɔmɔ o bakɛndii ba itumba i mondela inka Bayuda, lina Yailo, ayakaki. Ɔɛnɛki nde Yesu, aoyauha o makaka manande <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />mpe aɔmɔbɔndɔ na ipeta ntepela mbɔ: «Ngana omi o ngainto o ɛlɛngɛ akatana na iwa, yakaka omohangie makata olongi abike mpe ayale na bɔmɔi!» <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Yesu ahaki mputa na nde. Impinga i inɛnɛ imoiyelaki mpe imɔmɛnyɛki.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Eliki na ngainto ɔmɔ otungiamaki na ikoni intangi makila mebu liomu na mepe. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Anyɔkwamaki penda onka menganga meike, mpe abungiaki binkuma biliki nande boiko tabata bwenzi; nsande, ikɔni ipendaki nko mpependa. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Boiko ngainto oiko aokaki litepwamaki onga na Yesu. Ayakaki o mbiha enka impinga, mpe aokaki etobo enande. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Na itina ayahangelaki: «Kaki naokata nsa bitobo binande, nangobikiama.» <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Nko o elaka ɛlɔkɔ, makila matangaki matenaki mpe aokaki o bionge binande mbɔ aobikiama o liale inande. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Nko o elaka ɛlɔkɔ, Yesu aokaki mbɔ nguya ɛɔbɛlɛ o iyɔngɔ inande. Abutwaki o iyɔngɔ i impinga mpe atepelaki: «Ombokate bitobo bimi nɔni?» <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Baekoli banande bamoisenyelaki: «Ɔɛnɛ impinga ikɔmɛtɛ mpe oubola: “Ombonkate nɔni?”» <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Ya Yesu alendaki mbiha na mbiha nwɛnɛ ngainto nɔni olokelaki. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Boiko ngainto aoyoka bɔɔmɔ mpe aobilima nweba loiko lomoiyelaki; ahaki noyauha o makaka manka Yesu mpe aomwebia iliɔlɔ inkuma. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Ya Yesu ndɛmbɔ: «Ngana o mi o ngainto, bwambi bɔwɛ bokobikia. Nsɔ na nyɛ mpe bikiama o liale iwɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Nko aiko otepelaki nde boiko, metwantomo mioyoima onka mɔkɛndii mo itumba i mondela inka Bayuda mpe miomwebia bɔnɛ: «Ngana ɔwɛ o ngainto aowa. Itina isia wɛ notungia Molaki be?» <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Ya Yesu tabapwa na moiye, aohangela mɔkɛndii mo itumba i mondela: «Tokake bɔɔmɔ, aamba nko nyamamba.» <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Mpe tapa epohe onka moto nsa ɔmɔ noha mputa nande, umonya nko Petelo, Zake na Yoane, mohikɔlɔ o mwele onka Zake. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Oiyaki balɔkɔ o itumba inka mɔkɛndii mo itumba i mondela, Yesu aoywɛnɛ boyapoma bato, na bilelo mpe mianze na nsimo. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Aɔyɔtwa mpe aobaebia bɔnɛ: «Itina iyapoma inyo na bilelo be? Ngana tawili ya aɔngi ilɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Ya bamɔhɛkɛki. Na boiko, abɛliaki bato bankuma o nanda mpe apwaki mputa nande, ihe na nyango enka ngana mpe bakɛndɛki nande, boiko aɔtwaki mpiko oliki ngana. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Amokataki o ikata mpe aomohangela ndɛmbɔ: «Talita kumi!» nimbo mbɔ «Ɛlɛngɛ e ngainto, nakwebia, tɛlɛmɛ!». <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Nko o elaka eiko, ɛlɛngɛ e ngainto aɔtɛli mpe aobanda nɔkɛndɛ naitina aliki na mebu liomu na mepe. Nkaiko, bankuma bakakatanaki. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Ya Yesu abakokomiaki mbɔ moto nsa ɔmɔ talwebake; mpe abahangelaki mbɔ: «Bopa ɛlɛngɛ e ngainto biomba bi ndei.»<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Bato ba Nazaleta tabaamba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13, 53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4, 16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu aumwaki aiko mpe ayakaki o bola bonande<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Mat 13.54.</char></note>; mpe baekoli banande bamoiyelaki. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />O boina bo sabala, alakaki o itumba i lobondela inka Bayuda. Boike bo bamokaki baemwaki. Baubolaki: «Liko imoimenena o be? Boiko bwanya bomopaemena bole ngamo mpe mpapo ilolenge lɔnɛ ikelama na makata manande? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Nde tambe sapate, ngana onka Malia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Yoane 6.42.</char></note>, mpe mohikɔlɔ onka Zake, Yɔsɛ, Yude mpe na Simona? Mpe ba nkana banande tabambe mputa na iho anɛ?» Mpe bataki mabaku noyala nko mwamba. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Boiko, Yesu abaebiaki ndɛmbɔ: «Nteti amingwelamake nko o bola bonande, o iyɔngɔ i bokundu bonande mpe na itumba inande<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Luka 4.24; Yoane 4.44.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Mpe taisia nokela mpapo enkina aiko, lendaka abikiaki ngano bakoni bankina nobahangiaka makata. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Yesu aemwaki na bohenga bo bwambi bo balɔkɔ.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Lotomo lonka baekoli liomu na bape banka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10, 5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9, 1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Ombiha, Yesu akumbolaki o bihe binkuma biliki bɛlɛbɛlɛ nolakake Nsango Ndɔti. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Abeyaki baekoli banande liomu na bape. Mpe abandaki nobatinda bape bape. Abapaki bonkumu o liko inka melimo me bompunda <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />mpe abapaki lotomo: «Noyala nkopwa yomba o mokingi, umonya nko itengu; na impa pɔ, mango pɔ, mɔhɔlɔ mpe o monsenge pɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Bikoto bilɔtɔ inyo nko ba sandale mpe tabopwake makakia mape.»<verse eid="MRK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Mpe Yesu aisiaki nobaebia: «O manda enkina kaki bɔtwa o itumba imɔ, bokihaka aiko kii o elaka engoumwe inyo o manda ɛlɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Kaki manda be epa balɔkɔ tababwamba mpe tababokanya, ongoumwe inyo, bopupolaka motuku mo makaka manyainyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Bik 13.51; 18.6.</char></note>: aiko engoyala motato onka balɔkɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Bahaki mpe balalolaki mbɔ ɛbɔtɔ bato baenze meloko. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Babɛliaki melimo mebe meike mpe babikiaki boike bo bakoni o mbiha e balɔkɔ nobahinga mauta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Zak 5.14.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iwa inka Yoane Moini</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9, 7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Nkumu Elode aoyoka batepela na boili Yesu, na itina lina inande iumaki. Bahangaki: «Yoane Moini aokundwa o iyɔngɔ inka bawi! ɛlɔkɔ eiko bonkumu bonkeli limpapo bole na nde.» <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Bankina bahangaka mbɔ: «Ele Elia» Bamɔ ndɛmbɔ: «Ale ɔmɔ o ba nteti bakala.» <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Okaka mbo liko, Elode ndɛmbɔ: «Yoane eiko etindaki mi bamotenake motu, ele nde okundwa!»<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Na itina, Elode atindaki babute Yoane mpe nomotomba o itumba i ikamba, na boili Elodiade, mwali onka mohikɔlɔ o nande Pilipo oiko obalaki Elode<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">lenda 8.27.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Na itina Yoane aebiaki Elode mbɔ: «Lɔpɔbɔte onka wɛ nopwa mwali onka mohikɔlɔ ɔwɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Lew 18.16; 20.21.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Boiko, Elodiade amoinaki mpe aondaki mbɔ Yoane abomame, ya taɔhɔ nolokela. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Ya Elode aokaka Yoane bɔɔmɔ, na itina aebaki mbɔ ale hembo mpe mwɛlɛmi, mpe amobatelaki. Ombomokake nde akakatanaki; nsa nde ambondake nomokanyaka. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Lendaka epohe ɛndɔti ɛnɛnɛki onka Elodiade o boina bo maepwelo ma mabotameno manka Elode. Nde akelaki ntɛkɔ ebeyaki nde bambɔti banande, bakɛndii ba bamani mpe na bingambi bi Galilaya. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Ngana o ngainto onka Elodiade aoyoye nobina mpe aobuloya moloko monka Elode na babeyaki nde. Nkumu aoywebia ngana oiko bɔnɛ: «Onzubole eiko eondi wɛ mpe nakokepa onka wɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Mpe amohumbelaki nsumbi mbɔ: «Enkuma enkonzubola wɛ, naɔhɔ nokapola na wɛ o iyɔngɔ nsa bonkumu bomi.» <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Elɛngɛ e ngainto aɔbɛlɛ mpe aohangela nyango enande: «Ɛbɔtɔ naubole yomba be?» Nyango ndɛmbɔ: «Motu monka Yoane Moini.» <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Nko na ihali, ɛlɛngɛ e ngainto aoyoisie onka nkumu mpe aomohangela: «Naondi ompae nkaiko yoko motu monka Yoane Moini o sani!» <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Nkumu aokaki mahɛi penda; ya na boili nsumbi enande mpe na babeyaki nde, tapoisia noboya. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Na boiko, Nkumu atindaki mpe apaki lotomo na ihali onka momani mobatela nɔbɛkɛ motu monka Yoane. Momani aohaka o itumba i ikamba notenaka motu monande. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Amɔbɛkɛlɛki motu mɔlɔkɔ o sani mpe amopaki onka ɛlɛngɛ e ngainto, nde mpe amopaki onka nyango enande. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Oambaki baekoli banka Yoane nsango eiko, bahaki nopwa molio monande mpe bamokundaki o iyita.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aolehia impinga i inɛnɛ i bato</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14, 13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9, 10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoa 6, 1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Baekoli bakokanaki onka Yesu mpe bamɔhɛkwelaki inkuma ikelaki balɔkɔ mpe ilakaki balɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Lendaka, Yesu aobaebia bɔnɛ: «Inyo banɛ bankina, boyaka nobulame o bohobe mpe bɔlie lopwa.» Na itina eliki na bato boike bamboyakake mpe bamboisiake, mpe balɔkɔ tabayala nsa na epohe nɔlɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Baotangwa na bwato noha o manda e bohobe. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Bato baoywɛnɛ Yesu na baekoli banande baotangwa mpe boike babaɔhɔlɔki; boiko, nyaima o mananga mankuma, bato bahaki mabango lo makolo o manda ɛlɔkɔ mpe baiyaki boho bo balɔkɔ.<verse eid="MRK 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Ohapwaki Yesu o bwato, aɛnɛki impinga i inɛnɛ; moloko monande moliki ntwatonda na mahɛi na itina baliki lo mbata lipa na mobateli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Met 27.17; 1 Bank 22.17; Ɛzɛk 34.5-6.</char></note> mpe abandaki nobalaka mbo boike. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Aiko opendaki elaka noleka, baekoli bayakaki bɛlɛbɛlɛ na nde nomwebia: «Manda ɛnɛ ele bohobe mpe elaka eoleka. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Isenya balɔkɔ o ngando na bihe bile bɛlɛbɛlɛ nohomba bindei.» <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Ya Yesu aobaisenyele bɔnɛ: «Inyo bamɛnɛ bobapa bi ndei!» Ya, babekolaki bɔnɛ: «Ɛbɔtɔ na iho noha nohomba bingwɛlɛ na mpata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Mat 20.2.</char></note> menkama mepe mpe tobapae bi ndei?» <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesu abaubolaki: «Bole na bingwɛlɛ binga? Bɔnsɔ bolende.» O mbiha enendi, balɔkɔ ndɛmbɔ: «Matano mpe na nsi ipe.» <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Mpe aobapa lotomo nobakihiya balɔkɔ bankuma, o maboko, o bibuhu. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Bakihaki o maboko ma menkama mpe ntuku i itano. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Yesu apwaki bingwɛlɛ biko bitano mpe na nsi liko ipe, aiyeyaki maiho o Liko, mpe aototia Nyambe. Atenakaki bingwɛlɛ mpe abipaki onka baekoli mbɔ babakapwele. Aisiaki mpe nokapola nsi liko ipe onka balɔkɔ bankuma. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Balɔkɔ bankuma balɛkɛki mpe bakindaki. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Mpe batɔngɔnɔki meuka liomu na mepe me biteni bi bingwɛlɛ na nsi lipalemaki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na 2 Bank 4.42-44.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Baiko balɛkɛki bingwɛlɛ baliki mele nkoto itano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aokɛndɛ o liko i ibeke i ebale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14, 22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoa 6, 15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Nkaiko, Yesu apaki baekoli lotomo nokondela o bwato mpe balɔnde nsɛmboka eni e ibeke i ebale o boho bonande, lokenge lo Betesaida, o elaka eisenyaki nde mɔmɛnɛ impinga. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Ombiha e nande noiyisenya impinga, aohaka o monkondo nobondela. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Oiyaki mpokwa, bwato boliki o iyɔngɔ i ebale mpe Yesu nde mɔmɛnɛ aliki o mokonda. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Ɔɛnɛki nde mbɔ baekoli baliki na liale noluka na itina ɛpɛli ebaimba, bɛlɛbɛlɛ na melonge aoyoye onka balɔkɔ nkɛkɛndɛ o liko i mai, mpe aondaki nobalekana. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Ɔmwɛnɛki baekoli mbɔ aokɛnde o liko i mai, baokanena mbɔ aliki elima mpe baototwa na nsimo. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Na itina bankuma bamwɛnɛki mpe babilimaki. Ya na ihali, aobahangela: «Bokahwa! Ele nko mi; tabokake bɔɔmɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Akondelaki o bwato boliki balɔkɔ mpe ɛpɛli ehilaki. Bakakatanaki penda, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />na itina, tabaɔhɔlo na boili mpapo i bingwɛlɛ: meloko me balɔkɔ meliki boolo.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aobikia bakoni o mokonda mo Genesaleta</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mat 14, 34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />O mbiha empendi ibeke i ebale, baiyaki o mokonda mo Genesaleta mpe bahɛmɛki. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Ohapwaki balɔkɔ o bwato, bato baɔhɔlɔki Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Na boiko, bato bakumbolaki mokonda monkuma mpe babandaki nɔbɛkɛ bakɔni mbebeba o matɔkɔ mpiko o manda eambaki balɔkɔ mbɔ aliki. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Manda inkuma iɔtwaki Yesu, bihe, mananga mpe na mengando, batandaki bakɔni palapala o manda i makoka mpe bamɔbɔndɔki mbɔ abakambie bamokate nsa o lolemba lo etobo enande; mpe baiko bankuma bamokataki babikaki.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ilako itopaliela bankee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-20">Mat 15, 1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Bapalusi na bamɔ balaki ba mokeko baimaki o Yelusalema baokokana onka Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Baɔywɛnɛ mbɔ bamɔ baekoli banande balɛkɛke biomba bi balɔkɔ makata bilili, nimbo mbɔ mapokolamake. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Na itina, Bapalusi na Bayuda bankuma bapɔlɛkɛke nkokola makata bɔlɔti: Lama na menketo menka bankee ba balɔkɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Luka 11.38.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />mpe oima balɔkɔ o manda i ntɛki, bapɔle kaki nani tapɛtwami na iyohi i mai. Mpe ele na menketo menkina meike menka bankee ba balɔkɔ mebatela balɔkɔ, nga lolenge lɔ lɔlɔti nokola nkɛni, mahaba, masaso [mpe ntange]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">menkanda menkina tamembe na lina liko. </char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Na boiko, Bapalusi na balaki ba mokeko baoyoubola Yesu bɔnɛ: «Itina be baekoli bawɛ bapoyakɛndiake o lolenge lɔ lɔlɔti nga bole monketo monka bankee, ya balɛkɛke biomba bi ndei bi balɔkɔ makata bilili?» <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Aobaisenyele bɔnɛ: «Bato ba lwalia! Isaya atepelaki liima onka Nyambe na boili inyo, na itina lɔkɛtɛmɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">“Ebumu ɛnɛ eonyangole nko ɔ mbɛbu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">ya moloko monande mole iteta na mi.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Baonyangole nko biangolangola</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">na itina malako maolake balɔkɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">male nko menketo menka bato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isay 29.13, </char></note>.”<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Bokambia mokeko monka Nyambe nolamema na menketo menka bato.»<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yesu abahangelaki: «Botabola nko na hɔlɔ mokeko monka Nyambe olongi bobatele monketo monyainyo! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Na itina Mɔsɛ atepelaki: “Umia ihe na nyango ɛwɛ”, mpe mbɔ “Oiko otakamela ihe enande na mpe nyango enande abɔtɔ nowa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Mab 20.12 na Dut 5.16; Mab 21.17 na Lew 20.9.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Ya inyo, bolakake mbɔ: kaki moto ɔmɔ ahangela ihe na mpe nyango enande: “Bohungi bɔ mbɔbɔte wɛ nobata onka mi bole Koloba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Koloba: nkɛti ɛnɛ eima o lokota lo alamɛ.</char></note>”, nimbo mbɔ “ikapo ile bulɛɛ”, <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />bomopae epohe noyala nko bakelela. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Na boiko, bɔndɔlɔ Mbo inka Nyambe na boili monketo mopalia inyo. Mpe bokela mbo boike o lolenge loiko.»<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbo ipita moto</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mat 15, 10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />O mbiha, Yesu aisiaki nobeya impinga i bato ndɛmbɔ: «Bonangole inyo bankuma mpe bɔhɔle bɔnɛ: <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Tembe na yomba eima o nanda enka moto nzɔtɛlɛ onka nde mpe eomopita. Ya eiko ɛbɛlɛ onka nde, ele eiko emopita. [<verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Oiko ole na matoi manzoki, aoke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mɔlɔngɔ mɔnɛ tamombe o menkanda me kala.</char></note>!]»<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Okambiaki Yesu impinga nɔtwa o itumba, baekoli bamoubolaki na boili ekolongo eiko. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Aobaisenyele bɔnɛ: «Na inyo mpe, bole nko na bohenga bo nzebi? Bopwebe mbɔ tembe na yomba ɛmɔ eima o nanda enka moto ɛɔhɔ nomopita, <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />na itina ɛlɔkɔ ɛpɔtwe o moloko monande, ya o ikundu inande, mpe eɔhaka o ibela?» Na boiko, atepelaki mbɔ biomba binkuma bi ndei bile pɛtɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Bik 10.9-16.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Aisiaki notepela: «Eiko ɛbɛlɛ onka moto ele eiko emopita. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Na itina, ele o ntei e moloko monka moto, manda eima bikaneno bi bibe bimotinda o mbo inɛ: ipuka, nziba, momi bato, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />mebako, nduli e mɔhɔlɔ, nkeli bobe, lwalia, mpoha imbe, bwala, nyaki, bikelakela, bolema. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Bobe boiko bonkuma bɔbɛlɛ o ntei enka moto mpe bomopita.»<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngainto o mobutu aimenya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat 15, 21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Okambiaki nde mpiko, Yesu ahaki o mokokolo mo Tile. Aɔtwaki o itumba mpe taonda mbɔ bamwebe, ya taɔhɔ nobomama. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Nko aiko, ngainto ɔmɔ oliki na ngana onande o ngainto otungiamaki na molimo mo bompunda, aokaki batepela na boili Yesu; mpe ayakaki noyauha o makaka ma nde. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Ngainto oiko tayala moyuda, mohi Peniki e Silia e ibotwa. Abɔndɔki Yesu nɔbɛlia molimo mo bompunda onka ngana onande o ngainto. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Ya Yesu amobekwelaki: «Kambia naino bana bakinde na itina tembe bɔlɔti nopwa ɛngwɛlɛ enka bana nokeuha onka maha ma mbwa.» <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Amoisenyelaki bɔnɛ: «Ele nko boiko, Nkolo, nsa na maha ma mbwa, onsɛ mesa, balɛkɛke mpuha ikitia bana.» <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Na boiko, Yesu ndɛmbɔ: «Na boili ntepeli eiko, nsɔkɔkɔ, molimo mobe mɔbɛlɛ onka ngana ɔwɛ o ngainto.» <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Aisiaki onka nde mpe, atanaki ngana abeti o nkengo: molimo mo mobe mohilaki nɔbɛlɛ.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aobikia ebubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Yesu akambiaki mokokolo mo Tile mpe aisiaki lo Sidona lokenge lo ibeke i ebale e Galilaya nopendia mokokolo mo Dekapoli. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Baɔmɔbɛkɛle ekinda matoi embotepelake na liale penda, mpe baɔmɔbɔndɔ mbɔ amohatie ikata. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Na boiko, Yesu amotangoyaki na impinga i bato, aɔmɔlɔngɔ mehai o matoi, aomwamamba lolemu na nsɔi inande mɔmɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Mpe, aiyeyaki maiho o liko, aoyaula nobenda ɛpɛli mpe aomwebia bɔnɛ: «Epata!» Nimbo mbɔ «Lipwa!» <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Nko o elaka eiko, matoi manande malipwaki, lolemu lonande loutwaki mpe abandaki notepela tɛndɛlɛlɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesu abakokomiaki noyala nkwebia moto; ya nsa bobakokomiaki nde, bapuliaki nko nolalola. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Baemwaki penda mpe batepelaki: «Aokela mbo ikuma bɔlɔti! Aokia bikinda matoi mpe atepeya bibubu!»<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aisia nolehia impinga inɛnɛ i bato</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat 15, 32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />O maina maiko, nga boisiaki impinga i inɛnɛ i bato nopula mpe yomba endei teisia noyala, Yesu aobeya baekoli banande mpe aobaebia ndɛmbɔ: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />«Nale na mahɛi na boili impinga inɛ, naitina iokela na lɛlɔ maina mahato male balɔkɔ mputa na mi mpe tabambe na biomba bindei. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Kaki no baisenya onka balɔkɔ nzala, bakotukwa o mboka, naitina bamɔɔ baimaki iteta.» <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Baekoli banande baomoisenyele bɔnɛ: «Tobate bingwɛlɛ bibalehia iho anɛ o bohobe obe?» <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu aobaubola bonɛ: «Bole na bingwɛlɛ binga?» Baomoisenyele mbɔ: «Nsambo» <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Mpe aopa lotomo onka impinga nokiha nsɛbɛnɛ o nse. O mbiha aopwa bingwɛlɛ biko nsambo mpe, o mbiha enande nototia Nyambe, aobiatola mpe aobipa onka baekoli banande olongi mbɔ babakapwele. Mpe baobikapola onka impinga. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Baliki mpe na ngano nsi inkɛ. Yesu aitwakwelaki mpe abahangelaki mbɔ baisie nobakapwela. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Baɔlɛ mpe baokinda. Baotongɔnɔ meuka nsambo me mpwa lipalemaki. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Lendaka, baliki bɛlɛbɛlɛ mele nkoto inɛi. O mbiha Yesu abaisenyaki, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />mpe nko o elaka eiko akondelaki o bwato mputa na baekoli banande mpe bahaki o mokonda mo Dalamanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bapalusi baubola elembetelo e mpapo</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mat 16, 1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Bapalusi baoyoye mpe baobanda nohia na Yesu lɔmpɛnyɛ nɔmɔlɛbɛlɛ ilonga. Baomoubola elembetelo ɛmɔ eima o Lobola. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yesu aokiɛtɛnɛ o moloko penda mpe aohanga: «Itina be bato ba elaka ɛnɛ baubola elembetelo? Nko na hɔlɔ, nabwebia bɔnɛ: Elembetelo nsa ɛmɔ tengobapaemena!» <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Na boiko, aobakambia, aisie nokondela o bwato mpe aopendia nsemboka eni enkina.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Levile<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Levile: ele mɔlɔ mopelia palini, kaki bakela mampa.</char></note> enka Bapalusi na enka Elode</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat 16, 5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Baekoli babopelaki nopwa mampa, ya baliki nko na imɔ kaika o bwato. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesu abakokomiaki: «Boyabakaka! Boyabatele na levile enka Bapalusi mpe na enka Elode.» <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Baekoli babandaki nohia lompɛnyɛ o iyɔngɔ i balɔkɔ na itina tabayala na mampa. <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu alɔhɔlɔki mpe aobaubola: «Bohia lompɛnyɛ na itina tabombe na mampa? Nani nzebi e nyainyo ele ndipama? Tabombe na nsɔhɔ? Bole na meloko meolo? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Bole na maiho, bɔpwɛne? Bole na matoi, bopoke? Bopwepwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Yil 5.21; Ezek 12.2.</char></note>: <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />oatolaki mi bingwɛlɛ bitano onka bato nkoto itano, bɔtɔngɔnɔki mpwa ipalemaki ntondiama o meuka menga?» Baohanga: «Liomu na mepe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda 6.35-44.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Yesu abaubolaki: «Oatolaki mi mampa nsambo onka mele nkoto inɛi, bɔtɔngɔnɔki mpwa ntondiama o meuka menga?» Balɔkɔ baisenyaki ndɛmbɔ: «Nsambo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda 8.1-9.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Boiko Yesu ndɛmbɔ: «Nani tabombe na nsɔhɔ?»<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aobikia ebolia maiho o Betesaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Oiyaki Yesu na baekoli banande o Betesaida, baomɔbɛkɛle ebolia maiho ɛmɔ mpe baɔmɔbɔndɔ mbɔ amokate. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yesu akataki ebolia maiho o ikata, amobɛliaki o nanda e ehe. Amotikaki nsɔi o maiho manande, amohangiaki makata mpe amoubolaki bɔnɛ: «Ɔɛnɛ yomba?» <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Olipolaki nde maiho, aomoisenyele: «Naɛnɛ bato, nabaɛnɛ lo mete, ya bakɛndɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Boiko, Yesu aisiaki nomohangia makata o maiho; mpe moto aoywɛnɛ polele: aobika mpe aoywɛnɛ na nsɔhɔli yomba ɛmɔ na ɛmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yesu amoisenyaki onka nde ntepela mbɔ: «Tɔtwake nsa na o ehe.»<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo aotatola mbɔ Yesu ale Kilito</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat 16, 13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9, 18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />O mbiha, Yesu ahaki nde na baekoli banande o bihe biliki bɛlɛbɛlɛ na inanga i Sezale e Pilipo. O mboka, aubolaki baekoli banande bɔnɛ: «Mi nale nɔni o ntepeli enka bato?» <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Bamobekwelaki mbɔ: «Yoane Moini, bamɔ mbɔ Elia, mpe bankina mbɔ ɔmɔ o ba nteti.» <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Mpe Yesu abaubolaki mbɔ: «Ya inyo, bohanga mi nale nɔni?» Petelo atepelaki nzisenya bɔnɛ: «Wɛ ole Kilito.» <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Na boiko, Yesu abakokomiaki noyala nkotepela nsa onka moto ɔmɔ.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aotepela na boili iwa mpe makundwelo manande</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 16:21-23">Mat 16, 21-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luk 9, 22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />O mbiha, Yesu abandaki nobalaka mbɔ: «Ngana onka bobato yɛngɔ anyɔkwe penda; aboyame na bingambi bi Bayuda, bankanga ba banɛnɛ banka Nyambe mpe balaki ba mokeko; abomame, mpe akundwe o boina bo mahato.» <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Yesu atepelaki lobo loiko nko polele. Na boiko, Petelo amokolaki o ntundu mpe amɔpɛlɛki. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Ya Yesu abutwaki, mpe alendaki baekoli banande, aoywangwela Petelo ntepela mbɔ: «Umwa, tangwa na mi, Satana, na itina bikaneno bi wɛ bipa binka Nyambe, ya binka bato.» <verse eid="MRK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />O mbiha Yesu akokanyaki impinga i bato mputa na baekoli banande mpe aobaebia bɔnɛ: «Kaki moto aondi nonziela, ayaboye nde mɔmɛnɛ, abebe ekulusu enande mpe anziele. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Na itina, oiko ondi nobikia bɔmɔi bonande angobobungia; ya oiko ondi nobungia bɔmɔi bonande na boili mi mpe Nsango Ndɔti angobobikia. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Kaki moto nobata molongo na ibondo, ya bɔmɔi bonande noha ibomi angobata intomba be? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Angopa be nobikia bɔmɔi bonande? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Na itina kaki moto anzoka mi nsɔni mpe mbo imi o iyɔngɔ inka bato ba elaka ɛnɛ, bapone Nyambe mpe bale ntondiama na nsɔpi, Ngana onka bobato mpe angomokela nsɔni, ongoye nde o mankɛmbɔ manka Ihe enande mputa na mentomwa menande mɛ pɛtɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesu aisiaki nobaebia: «Nko na hɔlɔ, nabwebia bɔnɛ: bamɔ o iyɔngɔ inyainyo tabangowa nkwɛnɛ Bonkumu bonka Nyambe nzaya na nguya.»<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aenziama lɔɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mat 17, 1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9, 28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />O mbiha e maina motoba, Yesu aopwa mputa nande Petelo, Zake mpe Yoane, mpe aobatombi o liko i monkondo mo motale mpiko oliki nko balɔkɔ kaika. Aenzaki lɔɔbɔ o maiho ma balɔkɔ; <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />bitobo binande biliki langi langi nko bwe bwe o lolenge lɔpɔhe nsa na moto ɔmɔ anɛ o nse nobiyia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na 2 Pet 1.16-18.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Elia na Mɔsɛ bababɛlɛlɛki mpe bakɛtɛki miamba balɔkɔ na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Na boiko, Petelo aohangala Yesu ndɛmbɔ: «Molaki, ele bɔlɔti iho noyala anɛ. Tɔtɛlie biɛmbɛ bihato, ɛmɔ itina iwɛ, ɛmɔ itina inka Mɔsɛ mpe enkina itina inka Elia.» <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Na iliɔlɔ, taɔhɔlɔ lotepela nde na itina baliki na bɔpɔlu. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Eombi eyakaki nobalipa mpe iyoi nyaima o eombi mbɔ: «Ɔnɛ ale Ngana omi o lolango, bomoke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda 1.11 mpe nkɛti ile o nse.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Nko o elaka eiko, baekoli balendaki mbiha na mbiha tabaɛnɛ moto nko Yesu mputa na balɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Osulwaki balɔkɔ nyaima o monkondo, abapaki lotomo noyala nkɔhɛkɔlɔ nsa onka moto ɔmɔ liɛnɛki balɔkɔ, kii o elaka engokudwe Ngana onka bobato nyaima o bawa. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Babatelaki lobo lɔlɔkɔ, ya bayaubolaki o iyɔngɔ i balɔkɔ nimbo enka: «“Nokundwa nyaima o bawa”?» <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />O mbiha, baekoli baubolaki Yesu: «Itina be balaki ba mokeko batepelake mbɔ yɛngɔ nko Elia aye boho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Mlki 3.23.</char></note>?» <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Abaisenyelaki bɔnɛ: «Ele nko hɔlɔ Elia aoye boho mpe abɔtie inkuma. Ya itina be lɔkɛtɛmɛ mbɔ yɛngɔ Ngana onka bobato anyɔkwe penda mpe amingwelame<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Isay 53.3; Nye 22.1-18.</char></note>? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Ya mi, na bwebia mbɔ: Elia aya, mpe bamokelelaki inkuma liondaki balɔkɔ nokela, nga bɔkɛtɛmɛki na boili nde. Bakelaki na nde nga bondaki balɔkɔ, nga botepela nkɛti na boili nde.»<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aobikia ngana ɔmɔ otungiamaki na molimo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mat 17, 14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9, 37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Oiyaki balɔkɔ bɛlɛbɛlɛ na baekoli banɛ bankina, baɛnɛki impinga i inɛnɛ i bato iyobalingola mpe balaki ba mokeko bahia lɔmpɛnyɛ na balɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Ɔɛnɛki bato Yesu, impinga inkuma iemwaki mpe ipuhwaki noha nomobeka. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu aoyoubola baekoli banande bɔnɛ: «Lobo lohia inyo na balɔkɔ lɔmpɛnyɛ be?» <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Ɔmɔ oliki o impinga amobekwelaki mbɔ: «Molaki, nambokɔbɛkɛle ngana o mi o mwele, atungiama na molimo mo mobe momotika ebubu. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Molimo momokatoyake manda inkuma, momokitiake o lɔbɔmbi, ngana aobɛlia nzulu o munya, aokela makiɛti mpe aɔlɛkwa bionge. Naubolaki baekoli bawɛ nɔmɔbɛlia, ya tabaɔhɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu abahangelaki ndɛmbɔ: «Elele epa na bwambi! Nangoyala na inyo kii elaka be? Nango boikela mpimba kii elaka be? Bɔmbɛkɛle ngana oiko.» <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Bamɔbɛkɛlɛki nde. Ɔɛnɛki nde Yesu, molimo mobanda nomokatoya; akitaki o nse, abingitwaki mpe nzulu ibɛlɛki o munya. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu aubolaki ihe enka ngana: «Aoyalela nokela boiko metia menga?» Ihe ndɛmbɔ: «Ima nko oliki nde iyaha i ɛlɛngɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Bilaka bike molimo mo mobe momobokake o twɛ na mpe o mai nokomba nomoboma. Ya kaki ɔhɔ nokela lobo yaka notohunge, otokele mahɛi!» <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu atepelaki onka nde mbɔ: «Otepela mbɔ: “Kaki ɔhɔ!” Ya inkuma iyɔhɛmɛ onka olobe oamba.» <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Nko o elaka eiko, ihe enka ngana aototwa: «Naamba, onsunge na boili bohenga bomi bo bwambi!»<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yesu ɛnɛkɛ impinga nkokana, amaki molimo mo bompunda: «Molimo mo motika ebubu, nakopa lotomo: bɛlɛ mpe toisiake nɔmɔtwela!» <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Na nsimo na nkato i nguya, molimo mo bompunda mɔbɛlɛki. Ngana aliki lo mowi; o lolenge loiko, bato bankuma baotepela mbɔ: «Aowa.» <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Ya Yesu amokataki o ikata, amokumaki mpe ngana atɛlɛmɛki. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Oisiaki Yesu o itumba, baekoli banande bamoubolaki o nkuku bɔnɛ: «Itina be iho tatɔhɔ nɔbɛlia molimo moiko?» <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesu aobaisenyele bɔnɛ: «Molimo mo lolenge loiko, yomba nɛmɔ ɛpɔhe nɔmɔbɛlia yɛngɔ nko lobondela.»<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aisia notepela na boili iwa mpe makundwelo manande</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17, 22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9, 43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Baumwaki aiko mpe bapendiaki o Galilaya. Yesu tayala na mpoha bamwebe. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Na itina alakaki baekoli banande mpe aobaebia: «Ngana onka bobato angohembwama o makata manka bato, bangomoboma; mpe o boina bo mahato, angokundwa.» <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Ya tabaɔhɔlɔ itina i lobo loiko mpe baokaki bɔɔmɔ nomoubola.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Openda bɔnɛnɛ nɔni?</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9, 46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Baiyaki o Kapalanauma. O elaka eliki balɔkɔ o itumba, Yesu abaubolaki bɔnɛ: «Loiko lombohianye inyo lompɛnyɛ o mboka be?» <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Ya bakihaki nko nye, na itina, o mboka, bahiaki lɔmpɛnyɛ nweba nɔni opendaki bɔbɛnɛ o iyɔngɔ i balɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Yesu akihaki, mpe abeyaki baekoli liomu na bape mpe aobahangela bɔnɛ: «Kaki moto aondi noyala moboo, abɔti noyale mombiha mpe mosali monka bankuma.» <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Boiko, apwaki ngana ɔmɔ, amɔtɛliaki o iyɔngɔ i balɔkɔ mpe o mbiha enande nomobwatela, aobaebia ndɛmbɔ: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />«Oiko oamba o lina imi ngana nga bole oni, anyamba mi kaika; mpe oiko onyamba aponyambe nko mi kaika, ya aamba na Oiko ontindaki.»<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oiko opototakamene ale o yaiho</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk 9, 49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yoane aoywebia Yesu ndɛmbɔ: «Molaki, twɛnɛki moto ɔmɔ aɔbɛlie melimo me mebe o lina iwɛ, mpe tokombaki nomonyangela, na itina nde tatoiyela.» <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Ya Yesu aomobekwela ndɛmbɔ: «Tabomonyangelake, na itina tembe na moto okela mpapo o lina imi mpe nko o elaka eiko, aotepela bobe onka mi. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Na itina oiko opototakamene ale mputa na iho. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Oiko olobe ongobopae mai ma mini o nkeni o lina imi na itina bole banka Kilito, nko na hɔlɔ, nabwebia mbɔ: tangobungia iyuta inande.»<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilako na boili nkolami o bobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat 18, 6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17, 1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />«Oiko olobe okola ɔ nsɔpi ɔmɔ o banɛ babakɛ banyambela, ku bɔlɔti onka nde batungie o nkingo ibɔkɔ i inɛnɛ linyungola mambo mpe bamouhe o ebale ɛnɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Kaki ikata iwe ikokola o bobe, tenaka ilɔkɔ; ele bɔlɔti onka wɛ nɔtwa o bɔmɔi bɔ bɔbɛlɛ na ikata imɔ na nobatela ma mape mpe noha o lupɛlu, ɔ twɛ lopolimake. [<verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />“Ɔkɔ, bilandialandi bitɔkɔlɔ bionge bipowakake mpe twɛ lopolimake hiɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mɔlɔngɔ mɔnɛ tamoyali o menkanda meike me kala. </char></note>”.] <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Kaki ikaka iwɛ ikokola o bobe, tenaka ilɔkɔ; ele bɔlɔti onka wɛ nɔtwa o bɔmɔi bɔ bɔbɛlɛ ikaka imɔ na nouhama na mamape o lupɛlu. [<verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />“Ɔkɔ, bilandialandi bitɔkɔlɔ bionge bipowakake mpe twɛ lopolimake hiɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mɔlɔngɔ mɔnɛ tamoyali o menkanda meike me kala</char></note>”.] <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Mpe kaki liho iwɛ ikokola o bobe, bɛlia ilɔkɔ; ele bɔlɔti onka wɛ nɔtwa o Bonkumu bonka Nyambe liho mɔmpwɛ na nouhama na mamape o lupɛlu. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />“Ɔkɔ, opowakake bilandialandi mpe opolimake twɛ hiɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Isay 66.24.</char></note>”. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Na itina moto onkuma angoleka o twɛ lɔ mɔnyɔkɔ mpe angobata mokwa olongi ayale pɛtɔ.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />«Mokwa mole yomba ndɔti; ya kaki mohenga ngɔmbɔ enka mɔlɔkɔ, ongoisia nokepa lolenge be? Boyala na mokwa onka inyo bamɛnɛ mpe boyala na nyɛ bamɔ mputa na bankina.»<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ilako inka Yesu na boili momi ibala</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mat 19, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16, 18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yesu aumwaki aiko mpe ahaki o mokokolo mo Yudea, nsemboka e Yaladɛnɛ. Impinga i bato isiaki nokokana onka nde mpe aisiaki nobalaka, nga lo mwekehelo monande <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Bapalusi bamɔkɛndɛlɛki nɔmɔlɛbɛlɛ ilonga. Bamoubolaki kaki lopaema epohe onka boome noboya mwali onande. <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu abaisenyelaki bɔnɛ: «Mokeko be mobopaki Mɔsɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Balɔkɔ baomobekwela bɔnɛ: «Mɔsɛ apaki epohe onka bome nɔkɛtɛ monkanda mo momi ibala mpe mo mpanzi mwali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Dut 24.1.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Boiko, Yesu abaebiaki bɔnɛ: «Mɔsɛ abokɛtɛlɛki mokeko moiko na boili meloko meolo me nyainyo. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Ya o ibando i molongo, “Nyambe abakelaki ngainto na mwele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iba 1.27; 5.2.</char></note>”. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />“Na itina ilɔkɔ, mwele angokambia nyango na ihe enande mpe angobahema na mwali onande, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />mpe balɔkɔ ba bape bangoyala moto ɔmɔ.” Na boiko, bainda bape ya baya moto ɔmɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iba 2.24.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Boiko tika moto ayale nko lamonya eiko eolamia Nyambe.» <verse eid="MRK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />O itumba, baekoli baisiaki noubola Yesu na boili lɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Abaisenyelaki bɔnɛ: «Kaki boome aoboya mwali onande mpe aobala onkina, aokela mobako onga na o boho; <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />mpe kaki mwali aoboya boome onande mpe aobala onkina, aokela mobako.»<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aotwakwela bana ba bakɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19, 13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18, 15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Batɔ bamɔbɛkɛlɛki bana ba bakɛ olongi abahangie makata, ya baekoli babapɛlɛki. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Ɔɛnɛki Yesu boiko, aokaki bobe mpe abaebiaki ndɛmbɔ: «Bokambia bana baye onka mi! Tabobanyangelake, na itina Bonkumu bonka Nyambe bole bonka baiko bale lo balɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Nko na hɔlɔ, nabwebia bɔnɛ: oiko opwambe Bonkumu bonka Nyambe nga lo ngana ɔ mɔkɛ tangɔbɔtwa.» <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />boiko, ababwatelaki mpe abahangiaki makata nobatwakwela.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mobati</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19, 16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18, 18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Nga boliki nde o mboka, moto ɔmɔ ayakaki lobango, akukamaki makulubɔngɔ o boho bonka Yesu mpe amoubola bɔnɛ: «Molaki mɔlɔti, nakele be mbɔ natuke bɔmɔi bɔ bɔbɛlɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu amobekwelaki bɔnɛ: «Ombeya mɔlɔti itina be? Tembe na ole mɔlɔti, nko Nyambe mɔmɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Oeba mekeko: “Tobomake; tokelake mobako, toibake; totatolake motato mo mbolo; topwake na bwengeha; onaka ihe mpe na nyango ɛwɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Mab 20.12-16; Dut 5.16-20.</char></note>.” » <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Amoisenyelaki bɔnɛ: «Molaki, nabaka linko inkuma ima nko ɔ bɔlɛngɛ bomi.» <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu amolendaki na lolango mpe amwebiaki bɔnɛ: «Ohenga lobo lɔmɔ: nsɔ ɔtɛke binkuma bile na wɛ mpe opae mɔhɔlɔ onka bambɔlɔ, boiko ongoyala na bikatelo o Lobola; o mbiha yaka mpe onziyele.» <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Ya okaki nde boiko, aɔyɔngɔngɔli mpe aohaka na mahɛi na itina aliki mobati. <verse eid="MRK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu alendaki mbiha na mbiha, aoywebia baekoli banande bɔnɛ: «Ele liale onka babati nɔtɛlɛ o Bonkumu bonka Nyambe!» <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Baekoli bakakatanaki na litepelaki nde. Ya Yesu aisiaki nko nobaebia: «Bana bami, ele nko liale nɔtɛlɛ o Bonkumu bonka Nyambe! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Lole liale onka nyama ebeyama kamela nɔtwa o iyuhu i lɔnɔngɔ, ele mpe liale penda onka mobati nɔtɛlɛ o Bonkumu bonka Nyambe.» <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Baekoli bapendaki nko nwemwa mpe bayaubolaki o iyɔngɔ i balɔkɔ: «Na boiko ɔhɔ nobikiama nɔni?» <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu aobaihimia mpe aobaisenyele ndɛmbɔ: «Lipɔhɛme na bato, na Nyambe ile nsɔhɛmɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Na boiko, Petelo aomwebia bɔnɛ : «Lendaka, iho tokambia binkuma nokoiyela.» <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu amobekwelaki ndɛmbɔ : «Nko na hɔlɔ, nabwebia bɔnɛ: moto na ɔmɔ apɔhe nopalia itumba inande, bahikɔlɔ banande ba mele mpe na ba bainto, nyango enande, ihe enande, bana banande na mpe itia inande na boili mi mpe Nsango Ndɔti, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />aoyali nkobata penda monkama o elaka ɛnɛ: matumba, bahikɔlɔ ba mele na ba bainto, ba nyango, bana mpe matia, mputa na mɛnyɔkɔ; mpe o elaka eoye, bɔmɔi bɔ bɔbɛlɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Boike bo meboho bangoyala membiha mpe boike bo membiha bangoyala meboho.»<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atepela mbala e ihato na boili iwa mpe makundwelo manande</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20, 17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18, 31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Baliki o mboka noiyela o Yelusalema. Yesu ahaki nɔkɛndɛke o boho bo balɔkɔ; baliki na bɔpɔlu mpe ekambi ebaiyelaki baokaki bɔɔmɔ. Yesu aisiaki nopwa baekoli banande liomu na bape mputa nande mpe abandaki nobaebia liliki bɛlɛbɛlɛ nomokelamena. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Aobaebia bɔnɛ: «Aiko oiyela iho o Yelusalema mpe Ngana onka bobato angohembwama onka bankanga ba banɛnɛ banka Nyambe na balaki ba mokeko. Bangomopa ikamba i iwa mpe bangomohembola onka bakɛndii ba bihe bi babutu. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Bangomɔkɛngɔlɔ, bangomotwa nsɔi, bangomokula mepiokwa, bangomoboma. Mpe, o boina bo mahato, angokundwa.»<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moubola monka Zake na Yoane onka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat 20, 20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Na boiko, Zake na Yoane, bana banka Zebedai, babɛlɛmɛnɛki Yesu mpe baomoubola ndɛmbɔ: «Molaki, tolanga otokelele loiko lokokoubola iho.» <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Abaebiaki bɔnɛ: «Bondi nabokelele be?» <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Baomoisenyele ndɛmbɔ: «Otopae epohe tokihe o mankɛmbɔ mawe, ɔmɔ ɔ lɔbɔkɔ lɔwɛ lo lome ɔmɔ o lolwali.» <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Yesu aobaisenyele ndɛmbɔ: «Bopwebe lobo lobondela inyo. Bɔhɔ nomina nkɛni e mɛnyɔkɔ engomine mi, na mpe noinama na einameno e liale engoiname mi?» <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Baomoisenyele ndɛmbɔ: «Tɔlɔhɔ.» Yesu aobaebia ndɛmbɔ: «Nkɛni eiko engomine mi bongokemina mpe einameno engoiname mi bongoinama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Bik 12.2.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Ya, nokiha ɔ lɔbɔkɔ lomi lo lome na mpe o lo lwali, tembe mi olopa; lole onka baiko balondamema na Nyambe.»<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Okaki baekoli bankina liomu boiko, baokaki bobe onga na Zake na Yoane. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Yesu aobabeya mpe aobaebia bɔnɛ: «Bweba mbɔ, baiko baobekiama lo bankumu ba bihe babakamanyake na ekoheli, mpe bato ba nguya bainiama inɛɛ na nguya e bonkumu bo balɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Ya talombe boiko o iyɔngɔ i nyainyo. Nsande oiko ondi noyala bonɛnɛ o iyɔngɔ i nyainyo, tika ayale mosali mo nyainyo. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Mpe oiko ondi no yala moboho o iyɔngɔ i nyainyo, tika ayale mosali monka bankuma. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Na itina Ngana onka bobato taya mbɔ bamosalele, ya nosalela mpe nopa bɔmɔi bonande lo nzako nwakola boike bo bato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na 1 Tim 2.6.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aobikia ebolia maiho e lina Balatimayo</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20, 29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18, 35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Baiyaki o Yeliko. Nga bɔbɛlɛki Yesu o Yeliko mputa na baekoli banande mpe ngano impinga i inɛnɛ i bato, ebolia maiho ɛmɔ ebeyama lina Balatimayo, ngana onka Timayo, akihaki o ntundu e mboka nobondelaka biomba. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Ambaka mbɔ ele Yesu e mohi Nazaleta, abandaki nototwa: «Yesu, Ngana onka Dawidi, onzokele molika!» <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Baike bamwamaki mbɔ akihe nyɛ, ya nde aisiaki nototwa penda: «Ngana onka Dawidi, onzokele molika!» <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu atɛlɛmɛki mpe aotepela ndɛmbɔ: «Bomobeya.» Boiko, baomobeya mpe baomwebia ndɛmbɔ: «Kahwa, tɛlɛmɛ, akobeya.» <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Na boiko, abokaki monkoto monande, atɛlɛmɛki nyumbwa mpe aoyoye onka Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu aomoubola ndɛmbɔ: «Ondi nakokelele be?» Ebolia maiho aomoisenyele bɔnɛ: «Molaki, naisie nwɛnɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu aomobekwala bɔnɛ: «Nsɔ, bwambi bɔwɛ bokobikia.» Nko o elaka eiko, aisiaki nwɛnɛ, mpe aiyelaki Yesu o mboka.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aɔtwa o Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19, 28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoa 12, 12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Oiyaki balɔkɔ bɛlɛbɛlɛ na Yelusalema, bɛlɛbɛlɛ na Betepaze na Betania, baiyaki o monkondo mo Bilaya. Yesu aotinda bape o iyɔngɔ i baekoli banande <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />mpe aobaebia bɔnɛ: «Bɔnsɔ o ehe eiko ele onga na inyo, aiko ɔkɔkiɔtwa inyo, bokotana ngana o nyama e lina ane atungi, nani moto takekondeli. Boketungole mpe bokɛbɛke. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Mpe kaki moto aoboubola: “Bokela boiko itina be?” Bomoisenyelaka: “Nkolo akehenga, akoketinda na ihali.”» <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Bahaki mpe batanaki ngana o nyama e lina ane etungi o moiho mo nanda o mololo. Baoketungola. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Bamɔ baliki aiko babaubolaki bɔnɛ: «Itina be itungola inyo ngana oiko o nyama?» <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Babaisenyelaki nga bobaebiaki Yesu; mpe babakambiaki nolokela. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Babɛkɛlɛki Yesu ngana oiko o nyama; bakiapiaki bitobo bi balɔkɔ, Yesu akondelaki mpe akihaki<note caller="+" style="f">6<char style="fr" closed="false">11, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Zek 9.9.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Bato boike ba tandaki bitobo bi balɔkɔ o mboka, mpe bankina bikɔkɔ bi mete bi tenakaki balɔkɔ o matia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nga 2 Bank 9.13.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Bato balɔndɔki na babaiyelaki batotwaki: «Ozana! Atwakwame Oiko oye o lina inka Nkolo! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Botwakwame bonkumu boye bonka nkee e yaiho Dawidi! Ozana o manda ipenda kaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Nye 118.25-26. Lendaka Mat 21.9</char></note>!» <verse eid="MRK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Mpe Yesu aɔtwaki o Yelusalema kii o itumba i Nyambe. O mbiha enande nɔkɔtɔlɔ mbo inkuma ilekaki ɔkɔ, abɛlɛki noha o Betania mputa na baekoli banande liomu na bape, na itina mpokwa eiyaki.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aohila mote mo monkake</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mat 21, 18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />O mbiha e mpendu, ɔbɛlɛki balɔkɔ o Betania, Yesu aokaki nzala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Aɛnɛki iteta mote mo monkake mopukutana na nkaha, ahaki nolenda kaki na mpe akobata yomba ɔ mɔlɔkɔ; mpe ɔbɛlɛmɛki nde na mɔlɔkɔ, ya atanaki nko nkaha ntoo, na itina teyala motia mo mambo i monkake. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Boiko Yesu aebiaki mote mo monkake bɔnɛ: «Moto noisia nɔlɛ mambo ima onka wɛ nko hiɔ!» Baekoli banande baokaki mbo liko.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu o itumba i Nyambe</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 21:10-17">Mat 21, 10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19, 45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-16">Yoa 2, 13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Baiyaki o Yelusalema. Baɔyɔtwa o itumba i Nyambe mpe yesu aobanda nopanza batɛki mpe na bahombi o itumba i Nyambe; aobutola mesa inka baenzi ba mɛhɔlɔ mpe mbata inka batɛki ba bimenga, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />mpe takambia nsa moto abebe yomba nopendia itumba i Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Abalakaki mpe abaebiaki bɔnɛ: «Talɔkɛtɛmɛ mbɔ: “Itumba i mi ingobeyama itumba i mondela inka makundu mankuma”? Ya inyo, boitika ibomba inka bapunzi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia Isay 56.7; Yil 7.11.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Bankanga ba banɛnɛ banka Nyambe na balaki ba mokeko bambaki mpe bakombaki lolenge longomobome balɔkɔ; na itina bamokaki bɔɔmɔ, na itina impinga iemwaki na boili ilako inande. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Oiyaki mpokwa, Yesu na baekoli banande baɔbɛlɛ o inanga.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na mote mo monkake moma</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mat 21, 20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Olekaki Yesu na baekoli banande na mpendu, baɔywɛnɛ mote moiko mo monkake moma kii o melio. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Petelo aoywepwa, mpe aohangela Yesu bɔnɛ: «Molaki, lenda, monkake mohilaki wɛ moma monkuma.» <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesu aobekwela baekoli banande bɔnɛ: «Boyala na bwambi onka Nyambe! <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Nko na hɔlɔ nabwebia bɔnɛ, kaki moto aebia monkondo mbɔ: “Umwa mpiko mpe yauha o ebale ɛnɛnɛ”, mpe kaki tahia lɔmpɛnyɛ o moloko monande, ya aimenya mbɔ litepela nde ingoiya, longomopaema. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Ɛlɔkɔ eiko, nabwebia bɔnɛ: Binkuma biubola inyo o mondela, boimenya mbɔ bobibataki mpe bilɔkɔ bingobopaemena. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Mpe kaki bɔtɛli nobondela, mpe bole na lobo na moto, bomohabinye, olongi Ihe e enyainyo ele o Lobola abohabinye na inyo mabunga ma nyainyo. [<verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Ya kaki bopohabinye bankina, Ihe enyainyo ele o Lobola, tangobohabinya nsa lopwa bobe bokela inyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Mat 6.15.</char></note>.]»<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bonkumu bonka Yesu boima manda be ?</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21, 23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20, 1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Baoyoisie o Yelusalema. Aiko oliki Yesu aha, aisia o itumba i Nyambe, bankanga ba banɛnɛ banka Nyambe, balaki ba mokeko na bingambi bi Bayuda baoyoye bɛlɛbɛlɛ na nde. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Balɔkɔ bamoubolaki bɔnɛ: «Okela mbo inɛ na bonkumu bole o be? Na mpe okopa bonkumu nɔni noikela?» <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu aobaisenyele bɔnɛ: «Nakoboubola nko moubola mɔmɔ; kaki bombekola, aiko nakobwebia bonkumu boikela mi. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Boinami bonka Yoane boimaki o Lobola na mpe onka bato? Bonzisenye mwambo.» <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Bakanenaki o iyɔngɔ i balɔkɔ bɔnɛ: «Kaki tohanga: “O Lobola”, akotoubola: “Itina be ipa inyo tabomoimenya?” <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Tokomwebia bɔnɛ: “Onka bato…”?» Baokaki impinga bɔɔmɔ, na itina bato bankuma bakanenaki mbɔ Yoane aliki hɔlɔ nteti. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Boiko baomoisenyele mbɔ: «Topwebe.» Mpe Yesu aobabekwela bɔnɛ: «Nami mpe, napobohangele bonkumu boikela mi.»<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ekolongo enka bauteli ba babe ba itia i mete me vinyo</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21, 33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20, 9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Boiko Yesu abandaki notepela na balɔkɔ o bikolongo: «Moto ɔmɔ ahikaki itia i mete me vinyo; aikombelaki na mete, atimaki ipoku i nyami mambo, mpe aotonga eliko enka babateli. O mbiha aikatiaki onka bauteli ba itia i mete me vinyo mpe ahaki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Isay 5.1-2.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Oiyaki elaka, atindaki mosali mɔmɔ onka bauteli ba itia nomopwela inande ibondo i mambo. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Bauteli ba itia bamobutaki, bamokulaki mpe bamoisenyaki nko na makata. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Na boiko, mɔmɛnɛ itia aisiaki nobatindela mɔmɔ mosali; na oiko mpe, baomokula o motu mpe baomonyaka. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Aisie notinda monkina, oiko mpe, baomoboma; mpe bamɔ boike bakulamaki nkutu mpe bankina babomamaki. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Mɔmɛnɛ itia apalemaki nko na ngana o nande o mwele ɔmɔ o lolango. Amotindaki o mbiha e balɔkɔ bankuma ntepela mbɔ: “Bangona ngana omi o mwele.” <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Ya bauteli ba itia batepelaki o iyɔngɔ i balɔkɔ mbɔ: “Ɔnɛ motuki o ibula! Boyaka, tomobome, mpe ibula ingoyala iyaiho!” <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Baomobuta, baomoboma mpe baomouha o nanda e itia i mete me vinyo. <verse eid="MRK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Longokele mɔmɛnɛ itia i mete me vinyo be? Angoya, angoboma bauteli ba itia mpe angoipa onka bauteli bankina. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Inyo tabotangeli nkɛti inɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">“Ibɔkɔ iuhaki batongi ba itumba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">iya ibɔkɔ iotikama o ikono itumba.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Loiko loima onka Nkolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">o maiho mayaiho, lole mpapo!”»<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Bakɛndii banka Bayuda bakombaki nomobuta, ya baoyoka impinga i bato bɔɔmɔ na itina baɔhɔlɔki mbɔ ahɛkɔlɔki ekolongo eiko na boili balɔkɔ. Bamokambiaki mpe bahaki.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mputi eutama onka Kaisala</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22, 15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20, 20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Batindelaki Yesu ngano Bapalusi mpe ngano bato ba etuluku enka Elode mbɔ bamɔlɛbɛle ilonga nomotepeya. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Baoyoye noubola Yesu bɔnɛ: «Molaki, tweba mbɔ wɛ otepelake li hɔlɔ; mpe opokake bɔɔmɔ na boili bikaneno binka bato mpe opolendake bilongi binka bato, ya olakake mboka inka Nyambe o lolenge lo hɔlɔ. Lopaema epohe, oho na mpe mpamba nouta mputi onka Kaisala? Tɔbɔtɔ nouta na mpe toyale nkouta?» <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Ya Yesu ebaka lwalia lo balɔkɔ aobahangela bɔnɛ: «Inyo bɔndɛbɛlɛ ilonga itina be? Bɔmbɛkɛle mpata ɛmɔ, naondi nakɛne.» <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Baomɔbɛkɛle ɛmɔ, Yesu aobaubola ndɛmbɔ: «Elongi mpe nkɛti inɛ ile inka nɔni?» Baomoisenyele bɔnɛ: «Inka Kaisala.» <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Na boiko, Yesu aobahangela bɔnɛ: «Bopa onka Kaisala bile binka Kaisala, mpe onka Nyambe bile binande.» Baemwaki penda na boili mbeko enande.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moubola na boili mankundwelo manka bawi</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22, 23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20, 27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Basadukai baoyoye onka Yesu. Balɔkɔ batepelake mbɔ makundwelo manka bawi tamambe. Bamoubolaki bɔnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Bik 23.8.</char></note>: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />«Molaki, Mɔsɛ atɔkɛtɛlɛki bɔnɛ: “Kaki moto ɔmɔ ale na mohikɔlɔ, aowa mpe aopalia mwali ya takambia bana, abɔti nobala etuka mpe nopa bokundu onka mohikɔlɔ oiko owa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Dut 25.5-6.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Baliki bahikɔlɔ nsambo. O boho aobala mwali mpe aowa tabota bana. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />O bape aobala ngainto oiko, aowa ya tabota bana. O bahato nko boiko, <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />mpe onka balɔkɔ ba nsambo tababota nsa ngana ɔmɔ. O mbiha e balɔkɔ bankuma, na mwali mpe aowa. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />O makundwelo manka bawi, ongokundwe balɔkɔ, o iyɔngɔ i balɔkɔ, mwali angoyala onka nɔni? Na itina balɔkɔ ba nsambo bamobalaki!» <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu ababekwelaki bɔnɛ: «Tabombe na ibunga aiko opwebe inyo eyale Nkɛti, eyale nguya enka Nyambe? <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Na itina, o makundwelo manka bawi, bali na baome tabangoisia noyabala, ya bangoyala lo mentomwa menka Nyambe o Lobola. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Na boili bawi babɔtɔ nokundwa, tabotangeli o buku enka Mɔsɛ eteni etepela na boili ibunza ipɛtɛki twɛ? Lolenge lomwebiaki Nyambe mbɔ: “Mi nale Nyambe enka Abalayama, Nyambe enka Isaka mpe Nyambe enka Yakobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Mab 3.2, 6.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Tambe Nyambe enka bawi, ya enka bale na bɔmɔi. Na boiko, bole o ibunga ipenda.»<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mokeko mopenda intomba</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22, 34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10, 25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Molaki mo mokeko mɔmɔ ahinzaki okaki nde mbɔ bahia lɔmpɛnyɛ mpe aɛnɛki mbɔ Yesu aisenya bɔlɔti. Amoubolaki: «Mokeko be mole o boho bonka menkuma?» <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu abekolaki ndɛmbɔ: «Mo boho mole: “Langola, Isalaele! Nkolo Nyambe e yaiho ale nko nde kaika. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Ondaka Nkolo Nyambe ɛwɛ na moloko mɔwɛ monkuma, na molimo mɔwɛ monkuma, na bwanya bɔwɛ bonkuma mpe na nguya ɛwɛ enkuma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dut 6.4-5. </char></note>.” <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Lenda mo mepe: “Ondaka moninga moto lowɛ mɔmɛnɛ.” Tembe na mokeko monkina mopenda bɔnɛnɛ lo meiko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lew 19.18.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Molaki mo mokeko aomohangelaki ndɛmbɔ: «Bɔlɔti ba, Molaki! Otepela hɔlɔ: Nkolo ale nko nde kaika mpe tembe na Nyambe enkina nko nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Dut 4.35.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Mpe nomonda na moloko mɔwɛ monkuma, na nzebi ɛwɛ enkuma, na nguya ɛwɛ enkuma, mpe noonda moninga moto lowɛ mɔmɛnɛ. Loiko lole bɔlɔti penda mputu inkuma mpe ntumbi meboma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Ose 6.6.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Ɔɛnɛki Yesu mbɔ aobekola na nzebi, aomohangela ndɛmbɔ: «Tombe iteta na Bonkumu bonka Nyambe.» Na boiko, moto nsa ɔmɔ taisia no moubola lobo.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilito na Dawidi</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22, 41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20, 41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Nga bolakaki Yesu o itumba i Nyambe aubolaki nɛmbɔ: «Balaki ba mokeko baɔhɔ notepela mbɔ Kilito ale o inkana inka Dawidi lolenge be? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Dawidi nde mɔmɛnɛ, ntondiama na Molimo mɔ Pɛtɔ, ndɛmbɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">“Nkolo Nyambe atepela onka Nkolo emi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">kiha ɔ lɔbɔkɔ lomi lo loome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">kii o elaka elobe etika mi malanga mawɛ o nse e makaka mawɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nye 110.1.</char></note>.”<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Dawidi nde mɔmɛnɛ amobeya “Nkolo”: boiko o lolenge be lole nde o inkana inande?»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 12:37">Yesu aokokomia impinga i bato na boili balaki ba mokeko</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23, 1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20, 45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Impinga iyike i mokaki na ibulwako. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />O ilako inande atepelaki bɔnɛ: «Boyabatela na balaki ba mokeko baiko balialeka na menkoto me metale mpe baondake ba babeke na boni o manda i makoka; <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />nokihaka o bikili bi boho o matumba ma mondela manka Bayuda mpe o manda i boho o bilambo. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Balɔkɔ bapunza biomba binka bituka bi bainto mpe bakela mondela i ntale ntale. Bangobata ikamba ipenda.»<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikapo inka ngainto o etuka e mɔmbɔlɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21, 1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesu akihaki nongama na lobulu lontiki makapo, alendaki lolenge lotika impinga i bato mɔhɔlɔ o lobulu lontiki makapo. Babati baike batikaki penda. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Mɔmbɔlɔ mɔmɔ mo etuka e ngainto ayakaki mpe atikaki mpata i nkɛ ipe, iɛlɛmɛki na ngano makota. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Yesu abeyaki baekoli banande mpe abaebiaki bɔnɛ: «Nko na hɔlɔ, nabwebia bɔnɛ: mɔmbɔlɔ mɔnɛ mo etuka e ngainto aotika penda baiko bankuma bambotike o lobulu lontiki makapo. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Na itina balɔkɔ bankuma bambopae mɔhɔlɔ mopa tamoyala na intomba onka balɔkɔ; ya nde, na boili bɔmbɔlɔ bonande, aopa monkuma moliki na nde, monkuma moliki na nde nobikiama.»<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aotepela na boili mpitani e itumba i Nyambe</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21, 5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Ɔbɛlɛki Yesu o itumba i Nyambe, ɔmɔ o baekoli banande aomwebia: «Molaki, lendaka! Lolenge lo mabɔkɔ, lolenge lo matumba!» <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu aomobekwela ndɛmbɔ: «Ɔɛnɛ matumba manɛ ma manɛnɛ? Na ibɔkɔ imɔ taingopalema o liko inka inkina; inkuma ingopitama.»<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mahɛi na mɛnyɔkɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24, 3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21, 7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Okihaki Yesu o monkondo mo Bilaya, ntakatolo na itumba i Nyambe, Petelo, Zake, Yoane mpe na Andele, babulamaki manda ɛmɔ balɔkɔ nande, bamoubolaki bɔnɛ: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />«Otwebie elaka engokelame ilɔkɔ mpe elembetelo lina be engwebie mbɔ mbo ilɔkɔ ingokelama.»<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesu ababekwelaki ndɛmbɔ: «Boyabakaka mbɔ moto nɔmɔ tabopengoyake. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Baike bangoya o lina imi, bangohanga: “Ele mi Kilito!” Mpe bangopengoya bato baike. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Ongoke inyo lotepwama na boili bitumba mpe mɛnkɛnkɛ me bitumba, tabokiɛtɛnɛke; yɛngɔ nko ikelame, ya tengoyala nani bouku bonka molongo. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Na boiko makundu mangoyatakamena, mpe mankumu na mankumu; o manda na manda, lɔbɔmbi longonyonga, engoyala na melaka me nzala. Engoyala lo ibando i lolamato lo ibota. <verse eid="MRK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Boyabakaka. Bangobohembola o meloi mpe o matumba ma mondela manka Bayuda. Bongokulama nkutu, bongotɛndɛmɛ o boho bonka bakɛndii ba bituka mpe na bankumu na boili mi, nopa motato monyainyo onka balɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Na itina, yɛngɔ nko Nsango Ndɔti elalwame nani o makundu mankuma. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Elaka engobotombe balɔkɔ nobohembola, tabokiɛtɛnɛke boho na lingotepele inyo; ya lingobopaemene o elaka eiko, bobaebiaka, na itina tembe inyo bangoitepele, ya Molimo mo Pɛtɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Mohikɔlɔ angohembola mohikɔlɔ onande kii o iwa, mpe ihe lolenge lɔmɔ na ngana onande; bana bangotakamena baboti mpe bangokela mbɔ baboti ba balɔkɔ babomame<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Mik 7.6. </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Bongoinama na bato bankuma na boili lina imi. Ya oiko ongoike mpimba kii o bouku angobikiama.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mahɛi ma penda</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mat 24, 15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21, 20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />«O elaka ɛngwɛne inyo “Mopiti mopenda nsoho” nzayala o manda epa nɔbɔte<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Dan 9.27; 11.31; 12.11. </char></note>, tika motangi aɔhɔle! Boiko, baiko bangoyale o Yudea balotaka o menkondo; <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />oiko ongoyale o mbalasani e liko i itumba inande ayale nkosulwa, taɔtwake o itumba inande nopwa yomba;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Mat 24.17 mpe nkɛti ile o nse.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />oiko ongoyale o itia taisiake o itumba nopwa monkoto monande. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Mahɛi onka bainto bangoyale na maemi mpe bangɔlɔumie o maina maiko! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Bobondelaka mbɔ iyale nkokelama o motia mo ehio. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Na itina, maina maiko mangoyala maina ma mahɛi o lolenge lopa ta lwɛnɛni ima o mabandelo ma yaliaki Nyambe molongo kii aikoyoko, nga bopa lɔlɔkɔ talongoisia noyala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Dan 12.1.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Mpe kaki Nkolo takɔkɔle maina maiko pɔ, nsa moto ɔmɔ tapobika. Ya na boili baiko bahɔlɔki nde, atenolaki maina. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Boiko, kaki moto aobwebia: “Lenda, Kilito ale anɛ!” Na mpe: “Lenda, ale mpini!” Tabomoimenyake. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Bakilito ba mbolo mpe ba nteti ba mbolo bangɔɛnɛnɛ mpe bangɔɛnia bilembetelo na mpapo nopengoya nsa na bahɔlɛmɛ, kaki longɔhɛmɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Boiko inyo, boyabatelaka! Naobokokopia na inkuma.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mayelo manka Ngana onka bobato</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24, 29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21, 25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />«Ya o mbiha enka liale liko, mwane mongolima, nsonge tɛngɔmɛngiama, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />miɔtɔ mengokita nyaima o liko mpe nguya i maliko ingokikihana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Isay 13.10; 34.4; Ezek 32.7; Yɔɛ 2.10; 3.4. </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Na boiko, bangɔɛnɛ Ngana onka Moto noya, ningama na biombi, ntondiama na nguya mpe na mankɛmbɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dan 7.13.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Boiko angotinda mentomwa menka Nyambe mpe angokokanya bahɔlɛmi banande nyaima o nkenge inkuma inɛi, ima o bouku bo nse kii o bouku bo liko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Dut 30.4; Zek 2.10; Neh 1.9.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilako na boili mote mo monkake</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24, 32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21, 29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />«Bɔhɔlɔkɔ lwɛlia na boili mote mo monkake: bikɔkɔ bi mɔlɔkɔ noyala bɔɔlu mpe nobɛlia nkaha, bɔngɔhɔlɔ mbɔ motia mo nzɔbɔlɔ mɔbɛlɛmɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Nko boiko, inyo mpe, ongwɛne inyo mbo liko nokelama, bwebaka mbɔ Ngana onka bobato aya bɛlɛbɛlɛ, aya nko o bikuke bi nyainyo. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Nko na hɔlɔ nabwebia bɔnɛ: elele ɛnɛ tengoumwa bopa mbo liko inkuma taikokiami. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Liko na nse ingɔlɛmwa, ya mbo imi taingoleka.»<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyambe mɔmɛnɛ aeba elaka e bouku</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mat 24, 36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />«Ya boina mpe ola, nsa moto ɔmɔ apobwebe, eyale mentomwa menka Nyambe, eyale Ngana; na ɔmɔ mpamba nko Ihe. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Boyabakaka! Bwɛtɛtiaka maiho, na itina bopwebe ongoye elaka. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Ele nga lo moto oiko ohaka mokingi: aokambia itumba inande, aohembola bonkumu onka basali banande moto na moto na lotomo lonande mpe apaki lotomo onka mobateli o ekuke nolambaka. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Boiko bolambaka, na itina bopwebe elaka engoye monkolo itumba: na mpokwa, na mpe na iyɔngɔ i botio, na melonge mpe na mpendu. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Kaki nde noyala nko bɔbɛlɛlɛ pwala mpe nobotana nko o ilɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Loiko lobwebia mi, nalwebia onka bankuma: Bolambaka!»<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Bakendii ba Bayuda banga mwango noboma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoa 11, 45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Pasika na ntɛkɔ e mampa mapa na mɔlɔ mo bopelu ɛbɔtɔki nokelama o mbiha e maina mape. Bankanga ba banɛnɛ banka Nyambe na balaki ba mokeko bakombaki lolenge nobuta Yesu na lwalia mpe nomoboma. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Na itina, batepelaki o iyɔngɔ i balɔkɔ: «O elaka e ntɛkɔ pɔ noyala nkɔkela ɛkɔkɛlɛ o iyɔngɔ inka bato.»<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngainto ɔmɔ autola Yesu malasi o motu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26, 6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoa 12, 1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">14, 3 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Mat 26.7</char>
    </note>Yesu aliki o Betania o itumba inka Simona ebikiamaki na ikɔni i mɛliɔ; oliki nde o mesa, ngainto ɔmɔ ayakaki na molangi mo alibatɛlɛ ntwatonda na malasi ma malɔti mpe ma motuya penda; malasi maiko makelamake na mote mo nsolo mohimbɔ lina nale. Aomolipola mpe aomautola o motu monka Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Bamɔ baoywangwa mpe baoyahangela: «Malasi manɛ mahaka ibomi itina be? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Malasi maiko mapɔtɛkɛmɛ penda mpata menkama mehato mpe nopaema onka bambɔlɔ!» Mpe bamokelaki lɔbɛli. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Ya Yesu aobekola ndɛmbɔ: «Bomokambia, bomokia liale itina be? Aonkelela lobo lopenda bɔlɔti. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Na itina, boyalake mputa na bambɔlɔ bilaka binkuma mpe kaki boondi, bɔhɔ nobakelela bɔlɔti; ya mi, tabongoyalaka nami bilaka binkuma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Dut 15.11. </char><char style="fp" closed="false" /></note>. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Aokela lɔmbɔhe nde nokela: aonsinga malasi o bionge boho nonkunda. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Nko na hɔlɔ, nabwebia bɔnɛ: manda inkuma lingolalwame Nsango Ndɔti o molongo na ibondo, lobo lonka ngainto ɔnɛ longotepwama nomwepwaka na boili lokela nde.»<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudasi akomba nɔhɛngɛ Yesu onka bankanga ba banɛnɛ banka Nyambe</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26, 14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22, 3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Yudasi Isikaliɔtɛ, ɔmɔ o ba liomu na bape, ahaki onka bankanga ba banɛnɛ banka Nyambe mbɔ ahembole Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Oambaki balɔkɔ nsango babulwaki mpe balɔbɔlɔki nomopa mɔhɔlɔ. Mpe Yudasi aɛngɛlɛki elaka ɛndɔti nobahembwela Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aɔlɛ ilambo i Pasika nde na baekoli banande</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26, 17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22, 7-14</ref>. <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoa 13, 21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />O boina bo boho bonka mampa mapa na mɔlɔ mo bopelu, bombobomake balɔkɔ matumbe ma mbata na boili ntɛkɔ e Pasika, baekoli banka Yesu baomoubola: «Manda lina be eondi wɛ mbɔ totu nokolondela ɔle ilambo i Pasika?» <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Mpe aotinda bape o iyɔngɔ i baekoli banande mpe aobahangela: «Bɔnsɔ o inanga, moto ɔmɔ akokumana na inyo, aobebe ekutu e mai. Bomoiyelaka, <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />mpe manda elobe ɛkɔtwa nde, boubole mɔmɛnɛ itumba mbɔ: “Molaki aubola: Nakɔlɛ mi na baekoli bami ilambo i Pasika o eteni e itumba ele o be?” <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Mpe nde akɔbwɛnia eteni e itumba ele o liko, ele nɛnɛ mpe mbɔtiama na inkuma. Ele ɔkɔ ɔkɔtɔbɔtiela inyo ilambo.» <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Baekoli baohaka mpe baɔyɔtwa o inanga; batanaki inkuma nko nga bobaebiaki Yesu, mpe baobɔtia Pasika.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Oiyaki mpokwa, Yesu aoyoye mputa na baekoli liomu na bape. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Oliki balɔkɔ o mesa nɔlɛ, Yesu aotepela bɔnɛ: «Nko na hɔlɔ, nabwebia bɔnɛ: ɔmɔ o nyainyo angɔnsembola, ɔmɔ ɔlɛ na mi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Nye 41.10.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Nyɔngɔngɔlɔ na mahei, baobanda nomoubola ɔmɔ na ɔmɔ: «Ele mi?» <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Aobabekwela bɔnɛ: «Ele ɔmɔ o baekoli liomu na bape, otika ikata mputa na mi o sani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda mpe Nye 41.10.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Na itina Ngana onka bobato angowa nga bɔkɛtɛmɛ lɔlɔkɔ na boili nde; ya boilela onka moto oiko ongokape Ngana onka bobato na boili nde! Lɔbɔtɔki onka moto oiko noyala nkobotama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Nye 22.2-19; Isay 53.</char><char style="fp" closed="false" /></note>.»<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Etanda</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26, 26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22, 14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Bak 11, 23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />O elaka e ndei, Yesu apwaki impa mpe, o mbiha e nande nototia Nyambe, aoyoiyatola, aopa baekoli mpe aohanga ndɛmbɔ: «Bopwaka, ɔnɛ ele bionge bimi.» <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Apwaki nkɛni mpe, o mbiha e nande nototia Nyambe, aokepa onka balɔkɔ mpe bankuma baokemina. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Mpe Yesu aobahangela ndɛmbɔ: «Ɔnɛ ele makila ma mi, makila ma Lobengwangano lonka Nyambe mautwaki na boili bankuma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Mab 24.8; Yil 31.31-34.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Nko na hɔlɔ, nabwebia bɔnɛ: tingoisia nomina mambo i vinyo kii o boina bongomine mi lintɛmu o Bonkumu bonka Nyambe.» <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />O mbiya enyembi Nyembo, babɛlɛki noya o monkondo mo Bilaya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Mat 26.30</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atepela bongomwangane Petelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:30-35">Mat 26, 30-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:33-34">Luk 22, 33-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:37-38">Yoa 13, 37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Mpe Yesu aobahangela ndɛmbɔ: «Inyo bankuma bongokitiama, na itina lɔkɛtɛmɛ mbɔ: “Nangokula mobateli, mpe mbata ingwanzwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zek 13.7. </char></note>”. <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Ya o mbiha e makundwelo ma mi, nangolɔndɔ o Galilaya.» <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Petelo aomoisenyele ndɛmbɔ: «Nsa bankuma bangokitiama, ya mi pɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Mpe Yesu aomohangela ndɛmbɔ: «Nko na hɔlɔ, nakwebia bɔnɛ: wɛ lɛlɔ, o botio bɔnɛ, okonyangana mbala ihato boho bonka nkɔkɔ nobeka lobeka lo ipe.» <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Ya Petelo atepelaki na ipeta mbɔ: «Nsa kaki mi nowa mputa na wɛ, mpamba tingokwangana.» Mpe bankuma batepelaki nko boiko.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lobondela lonka Yesu o Getesemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26, 36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:40-46">Luk 22, 40-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Baoyoiya o itia ibeyamaki lina Getesemani, mpe aoywebia baekoli banande bɔnɛ: «Bokihaka anɛ, mi nahaka nobondela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Mat 26.36</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Aotombi mputa na nde Petelo, Zake mpe Yoane. Mpe aobanda nɔkiɛtɛnɛ mpe aoyoka bɔɔmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Aobahangela ndɛmbɔ: «Moloko momi mole ntwatonda na mahɛi kii o iwa; boyalelaka anɛ mpe bolambaka.» <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Mpe aohaka ngano iteta, akukamaki o nse mpe abondelaki mbɔ, kaki lɔhɛmɛ, elaka eiko emoumwamene. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Aobanda nobondela ndɛmbɔ: «Aba, Ihe, onka wɛ inkuma iɔhɛmɛ, ontangoye na nkɛni ɛnɛ. Ya, teyalake o mpoha emi, nsande o ɛwɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Aoyoye mpe aobatana baɔngi. Aoywebia Petelo: «Simona, wɛ ongi ilɔ? Toyala na nguya nolamba nsa ola ɛmɔ? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Bolambaka mpe bobondelaka olongi mbɔ boyale nkɔkita o malengoli. Molimo mole ntondiama na mpoha enkeli bɔlɔti, ya bionge bile bɔɔlu.» <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Aisiaki notangwa mpe aobondela nko na mbo ilɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />O mbiha, ayakaki mpe abatanaki nko baɔngi; na itina maiho ma balɔkɔ maliki nko na ilɔ. Mpe tabaeba lɔhɔ balɔkɔ nobekola. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />O loya lo ihato, aobaubola ndɛmbɔ: «Bɔngi nko ilɔ mpe bɔlia? Lokoka! Elaka eiya. Bolenda Ngana onka bobato aokapema o makata manka bato ba nsɔpi. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Bɔtɛlɛmɛkɛ, bototu! Bolendaka, mɔhɛngi momi aoya!»<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aobutama</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26, 47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22, 47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoa 18, 3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Nko aiko otepelaki nde, Yudasi e ɔmɔ o baekoli liomu na bape abɛlɛmɛki mputa na impinga i bato iliki na mabaka mpe na mɛbɔtɔ. Aliki tindama na bingambi bi bankanga ba banɛnɛ banka Nyambe, balaki ba mokeko mpe na bingambi bi Bayuda. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Ɔ mɔhɛngi onande aokanaki na balɔkɔ na elembetelo: «Oiko okopa mi molumba, ele nde. Bomobutaka mpe bomotombaka mbɔ abatelame bɔlɔti.» <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Nko aiye, aɔbɛlɛmɛnɛ Yesu mpe aomohangela ndɛmbɔ: «Molaki!» Mpe aomopa molumba. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Bankina baomokata nomobuta. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Ɔmɔ o baliki aiko akumaki ibaka, aokɛtɛ mosali monka nkanga ɛnɛnɛ enka Nyambe mpe aomotenaka itoi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Yoa 18.26.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesu aobahangela ndɛmbo: «Boya na mabaka na mɛbɔtɔ nombuta, ngamo naya nde mokɛndii monka bapunzi? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Maina mankuma naliki mputa na inyo o itumba i Nyambe nolaka, mpe tabombuta. Ya ele nko olongi Nkɛti ikokiame.» <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Na boiko, balɔkɔ bankuma bamokambiaki mpe balotaki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na 14.27.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Ɛlɛngɛ e mwele ɛmɔ amoiyelaki, aliki nko na etobo e nkuki bionge. Bamobutaki, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />ya nde akambiaki etobo ɛlɔkɔ mpe alotaki nko ihɛlɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu o boho bo Moloi mɔ mɔnɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mat 26, 57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22, 54-55</ref>. <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoa 18, 13-14</ref>. <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Batombaki Yesu onka nkanga ɛnɛnɛ enka Nyambe. Bankanga ba banɛnɛ banka Nyambe, bingambi bi Bayuda mpe na balaki ba mokeko bakokanaki balɔkɔ bankuma. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Petelo amoiyelaki iteta mpe aɔtwaki o ntei e ipana inka nkanga ɛnɛnɛ enka Nyambe. Akihaki mputa na basali mpe aɔkɔki twɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Lendaka,bankanga ba banɛnɛ banka Nyambe mpe Moloi mɔ mɔnɛnɛ monkuma baɛngɛlɛki motato onga na Yesu nomoulia o iwa, ya tabalobata. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Na itina boike bo bato bapaki metato me mbolo onga na Yesu, ya mɛlɔkɔ tamelongama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 56 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Nye 27.12; 35.11.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Bamɔ batɛlɛmɛki nopa motato mo mbolo onga nande ntepela mbɔ: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />«Tomokaki atepela: “Mi, nangopita itumba inɛ i Nyambe itongamaki na makata manka bato, mpe nangotonga o maina mahato lipa taingotongama na makata manka bato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 58 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Yoa 2.19.</char></note>.”» <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Ya nsa na boiko tabayala na nzokani o motato mo balɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Nkanga ɛnɛnɛ enka Nyambe, aɔtɛli o iyɔngɔ i ikoka mpe aoyoubola Yesu: «Opobekole na boili metato mepa balɔkɔ onga na wɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Ya nde aliki nko nyɛ, tabekola. Nkanga ɛnɛnɛ enka Nyambe aisie nomoubola bɔnɛ: «Wɛ ole Kilito, Ngana onka Nyambe etwakwama?» <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu amoisenyelaki ndɛmbɔ: «Mi nale nko boiko, mpe bɔngwɛnɛ Ngana onka bobato nkiakiha o lɔbɔkɔ lo lome lonka Nyambe e Nguya mpe nzaya mputa na biombi bi liko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 62 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nye 110.1; Dan 7.13.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Nkanga ɛnɛnɛ aoywatola bitobo binande mpe atepelaki bɔnɛ: «Toinda na mpoha na bapa metato! <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Booka nga bonyakatanela nde Nyambe. Bokanena be?» Boiko, bankuma baomoulia nomopa ikamba i iwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 64 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Lew 24.16.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Bamɔ babandaki nomotwa nsoi, nomolipa elongi, nomokula mabɔtɔ mpe balɔkɔ baomoubola ndɛmbɔ: «Ebaka ombokokule!» Mpe basali bamwambaki na bipakata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 65 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Isay 50.6.</char></note>.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 14:65">Petelo angana Yesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:65">(Lenda mpe Mat 26, 69-75; Luk 22, 56-62; Yoa 18, 15-18, 25-27)<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Oliki Petelo o nse e ipana, ɔmɔ o basali ba bainto banka nkanga ɛnɛnɛ aoyoye. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Ɛnɛkɛ Petelo aɔkɔ twɛ, aomoihimia mpe aomwebia: «Wɛ mpe, oliki mputa na Yesu e mohi Nazaleta.» <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Ya Petelo aoywagana ntepela mbɔ: «napwebe mpe napɔhɔle londi wɛ notepela.» Mpe abɛlɛki o ekuke e ipana. [Na boiko, nkɔkɔ ebekaki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 68 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">imɔ nkɛti taimbe na maina maiko </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Nkɔkɔ ebekaki. </char></note>.] <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Mosali moiko mo ngainto aomwɛnɛ mpe aisiaki nwebia baiko baliki aiko: «Moto oiko ale ɔmɔ o balɔkɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Ya Petelo aisiaki nko nwangana. O mbiha e ngano elaka, ekambi eliki aiko baisiaki nwebia Petelo mbɔ: «Nko na hɔlɔ, ole ɔmɔ o balɔkɔ, na itina, wɛ mpe ole mohi Galilaya.» <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Na boiko, Petelo abandaki nohumba nsumbi mputa na mehilako mbɔ: «Napwebe moto oiko onzebia inyo!» <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Nko o elaka eiko, nkɔkɔ ebekaki lobeka loipe, mpe Petelo aoywepwa limohangelaki Yesu: «Boho bonka nkoko nobeka lobeka loipe, ongonyangana mbala ihato.» Na boiko, abɛlɛki nkulumwa mpe alelaki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 72 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda 14.30.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu o boho bonka Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27, 1-2</ref>. <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoa 18, 28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Na ntei e mpendu, bankanga ba banɛnɛ banka Nyambe bakokanaki mputa na bingambi bi Bayuda, balaki ba mokeko mpe Moloi mo mɔnɛnɛ monkuma. Baoyondola Yesu, baomotombi mpe baomohembola onka Pilato. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilato amoubola: «Wɛ ole nkumu enka Bayuda?» Yesu aomobekwela bɔnɛ: «Nko nga botepela wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Mat 27.11</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Bankanga ba banɛnɛ bamɔhɛngɛki na mbo boike. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilato asiaki nomoubola: «Wɛ tombe na mbeko? Lenda liko inkuma likohɛngɛ balɔkɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Ya Yesu tabekola nsa mbekola, na boiko Pilato aemwaki. <verse eid="MRK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />O bilaka binkuma bi ntɛkɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ntɛko ɛnɛ ele ntɛkɔ e Pasika. </char></note>, ambɔbɛliake mobutami mɔmɔ, momboubolake balɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Nsande, oiko obeyamaki Balaba aliki o itumba i ikamba mputa na babomi baongolaki ɛkɔkɛlɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Impinga i bato iohaka mpe iobanda noubola Pilato liobakelele nde bakabaka. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilato aobaisenyele: «Boondi nabɔbɛliele nkumu enka bayuda?» <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Na itina aɛnɛki mbɔ, bankanga ba banɛnɛ bamohembwelaki Yesu na boili bwala. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Bankanga ba banɛnɛ bakamanyaki impinga mbɔ bababɛliele Balaba. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilato aisiaki nobaubola bɔnɛ: «Nakele ngamo na oiko obeya inyo nkumu enka Bayuda?» <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Baomoisenyele ntotwa mbɔ: «Baka nde o ekulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilato aobaisenyele ndɛmbɔ: «Lo lobe lokela nde be?» Basiaki nototwa na nguya penda: «Baka nde o ekulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilato aondaki nobuloya impinga, na boiko ababɛlielaki Balaba; abahembwelaki Yesu o mbiha e nande nopa lotomo mbɔ bamokule mɔbɔtɔ mpe nobakema o ekulusu.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bamani baɔkɛngɔlɔ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat 27, 27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoa 19, 2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Bamani batombaki Yesu o moloi moliki o ipana inka mɔkɛndii mo etuka mpe babeyaki etuluku enkuma e bamani. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Bamɔlɔtiaki monkoto mo ngola mpe baomotika montolo mɔnsɛndɛ motongaki balɔkɔ o motu. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Mpe babandaki nomokulela nsaka: «Losako nkumu enka Bayuda!» <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Bamokulaki o motu na mɔlɛlɛngɛ, bamotwaki nsɔi mpe bakihaki makulubɔngɔ nkukama o boho bonande. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />O mbiha e balɔkɔ nomɔkɛngɔlɔ, baomotungola monkoto mo ngola mpe baomoisenyele bitobo binande. O mbiha baomɔbɛlia nomobaka o ekulusu.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aobakema o ekulusu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 27:33-44">Mat 27, 33-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:36-43">Luk 23, 36-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoa 19, 17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Baokamanya Simona e mohi Kulɛnɛ, ihe enka Alekisandele na Lupusi olekaki nyaima o itia mbɔ abebe ekulusu enka Yesu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Bal 16.13.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Mpe baomotombi o manda ebeyama Gologota elimbola «Lɔbɛkɛ lo motu». <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Baondaki nomopa vinyo ehanganyamaki na mɔlɔ mobeyama mola, ya nde aokeboya. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Bamobakaki o ekulusu mpe baokapa bitobo binande, babikelaki bienzako nweba ekobata ɔmɔ na ɔmɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Nye 22.19.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Abakemaki o ekulusu o ola e ibwa e mpendu. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Itina i ikamba inande ikɛtɛmɛki bɔnɛ: «Nkumu enka Bayuda.» <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Babakaki na bapunzi bape mputa na nde, ɔmɔ o lɔbɔkɔ lo nande lo lome, o nkina o lo lwali. [<verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Oiko ele nkokiami e Nkɛti liebia mbɔ: «Aliki o motango monka bapunzi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Luk 22.37 mpe na Isay 53.12.</char></note>.»] <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Baleki bamonyakaki metu mpɛkia mpe ntepela mbɔ: «Ee! wɛ okitia itumba i Nyambe mpe oitonga o maina mahato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Nye 22.8; Yoa 2.19.</char></note>, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />yabikiaka wɛ mɔmɛnɛ noyasulonya o ekulusu.» <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Nko boiko mpe, bankanga ba banɛnɛ banka Nyambe mputa na balaki ba mokeko bamɔkɛngɛlɔki ntepela mbɔ: «Abikiaki bankina, apɔhe noyabikia nde mɔmɛnɛ! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Tika Kilito, nkumu enka Isalaele, asulwe aiko yoko o ekulusu! Kaki twɛnɛ boiko, aiko tomoimenya.» Babakemaki mputa nande mpe bamɔkɛngɔlɔki.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iwa inka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27, 45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23, 44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoa 19, 28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Oiyaki boina o motu, moilima moliki o nse enkuma kii o ola e ihato. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Mpe o ola e ihato, Yesu atotwaki na nguya bɔnɛ: «Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakatani», nimbo mbɔ «Nyambe emi, Nyambe emi, onsabola itina be<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nye 22.2,</char></note>?» <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Omokaki baliki aiko baotepela bɔnɛ: «Langola bobeya nde Elia!» <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Ɔmɔ apuhwaki ibango nolindia iyambu o vinyo e bokai mpe aikakiaki o nsɔngɛ e mɔlɛlɛngɛ, amopaki amine ntepela mbɔ: «Bolilaka, tolende na mpe Elia akoya nomosuloya mpiko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Nye 69.22.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Ya Yesu atotwaki na nguya mpe akomaki moloko. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Mpe etobo ɛlɛlɛmɛki o etei enka Manda e Bulɛɛ na Manda ependa Bulɛɛ eatwaki biɛti bipe nyaima o liko kii o nse<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Mab 26.31-33.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Nkumu enka bamani monkama atɛlɛmɛki o boho bo nande, ɔɛnɛki nde lolenge lokomaki nde moloko, atepelaki ndɛmbɔ: «Na hɔlɔ moto ɔnɛ aliki Ngana onka Nyambe!» <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Eliki mpe na bainto balendaki iteta. O iyongo i balɔkɔ: Malia mohi Magadala, Malia ma nyango enka Zake e Ɛlɛngɛ na Yɔsɛ, na Salɔmɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Bamoiyelaka mpe bamosalelaka o elaka eliki nde o Galilaya. Eliki mpe na bainto bankina baike baiyelaka na nde o Yelusalema.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aokundama</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27, 57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23, 50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoa 19, 38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Oiyaki mpokwa, na itina eliki Bɔkɔlɔngɔni bo boina bo sabala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda Mat 27.57 mpe nkɛti ile o nse.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yosepa e mohi Alimatayo, aoyoye. Aliki ɔmɔ o Moloi mɔ mɔnɛnɛ mpe alilaki na nde Bonkumu bonka Nyambe. Aliki na ipeta nɔtwa onka pilato noubola bionge binka Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilato aemwaki nwamba mbɔ aohila nowa. Atindaki babeye nkumu enka bamani monkama mpe nomoubola na mpe ahilaki nowa kala. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Okaki nde o munya monka nkumu enka bamani mbɔ aokoma moloko, aopa epohe onka Yosepa nopwa molio. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />O mbiha enka Yosepa nohomba nkamba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nkamba: ele molangiti mokundama melio. </char></note>, aosuloya Yesu o ekulusu, aomolinga na ɛlɔkɔ mpe aomokunda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aomokunda: lɔhɔ mpe notepwama «aomokambia» nga bole mokeli monka Bayuda nokundaka melio.</char></note> o iyita itimwamaki o ibɔkɔ i inɛnɛ mpe aibingitolaki ibɔkɔ inkina i inɛnɛ noilipa o munya monka iyita. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Malia mohi Magadala mpe Malia ma nyango enka Yɔsɛ balendaki manda ekundamaki nde.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Makundwelo manka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoa 20, 1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />O mbiha e boina bo sabala, Malia mohi Magadala, Malia ma nyango enka Zake na Salɔmɛ bahombaki mauta ma mɔhimbɔ noha nohinga bionge binka Yesu nobiomia olongi tabipɔndɔke. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Mpe na ntei e mpendu e boina bo boho bonka eyenga, ohilaki mɔnyɛnɛ nɔbɛlɛ, bainto baiko bahaki o iyita. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Bayahangelaki o iyɔngɔ i balɔkɔ: «Okotobungutwela ibɔkɔ ile o munya mo iyita nɔni?» <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Ya oiyeyaki balɔkɔ maiho, baoywɛnɛ mbɔ ibɔkɔ iobungutwa, nsande iliki inɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Na boiko, baɔyɔtwa o iyita; baoywɛnɛ ɛlɛngɛ e mwele, akihi o lɔbɔkɔ lo lome, alɔti monkoto mo menza, mpe baoyoka bɔɔmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Ya nde aobaebia bɔnɛ: «Tabokake bɔɔmɔ; bokomba Yesu e mohi Nazaleta, ebakemaki o ekulusu; aokundwa o iyɔngɔ i bawi, ainda anɛ. Bolendaka manda emokundaki balɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Ya bonsɔ nko aiko yoko nwebia baekoli banande na Petelo: “Aolɔndɔ o boho bo nyainyo o Galilaya; bongomwɛnɛ ɔkɔ, nga bobwebiaki nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda 14.28. </char></note>.” » <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Na boiko, baobɛlɛ mpe baolota iteta na iyita, na itina balɔkɔ bankuma babilimaki mpe bakakatanaki. Mpe tabaebia moto nsa ɔmɔ na itina baliki na bɔpɔlu.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 16:8">Yesu aɔyaɛnia onka Malia mohi Magadala</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 16:8">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28, 9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yoa 20, 11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Melɔngɔ 9-20 tamembe o ba buku nzike i kala.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Okundwaki nde na mpendu e boina bo boho bonka eyenga, Yesu abɛlɛlɛki boho Malia mohi Magadala, mabɛliaki nde melimo me mebe nsambo. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Malia mohi Magadala aohaka nɔlɔndwela baliki na Yesu mpe baliki o itale nolelaka. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Ya balɔkɔ okaka mbɔ: «Yesu ale na bɔmɔi, ambɔmbɛlɛle!» Ya balɔkɔ tabamoimenyena. <verse eid="MRK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />O mbiha ɛlɔkɔ, ayaɛniaki o lolenge lonkina onka bape o iyɔngɔ inka baekoli baisiaki o bola bo balɔko. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Mpe baekoli baiko bape baisiaki nɔlɔndwela bankina, na balɔkɔ, ya tababaimenyena.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aobɛlɛlɛ baekoli liomu na ɔmɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda mpe <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24, 36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoa 20, 19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Bik 1, 6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Na mbiha, Yesu ayaɛniaki onka baekoli liomu na ɔmɔ o elaka ɛlɛkɛki balɔkɔ; mpe abapɛlɛki na bohenga bo bwambi mpe na boolo bo meloko na itina tabaimenya baiko bamwɛnɛki o mbiha e makundwelo manande. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Mpe Yesu aobaebia bɔnɛ: «Bɔnsɔ o molongo na ibondo nolalolake Nsango Ndɔti onka bato bankuma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Bik 1.8.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Oiko ongwambe mpe ongoiname angobikiama; opatamba angouliama. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Mpe lenda bilembetelo bingwɛnɛne onka baiko bangwambe: O lina imi, bangobɛlia melimo me mebe, bangotepela o nkota i ntɛmu, <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />kaki bangokata nzɔ na makata ma balɔkɔ mpe baomina yomba ɛmɔ e iwa, tengobaokia liale; bangohangia makata onka bakɔni, bangobikiama.» <verse eid="MRK 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Aiko Nkolo Yesu o mbiha e ntepeli na balɔkɔ, aiyeyamaki o Lobola mpe aokihi o lɔbɔkɔ lo lome lonka Nyambe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nwɛlia na Bik 1.9-11.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Nga na balɔkɔ, bahaki nolalolake o manda inkuma. Nkolo asalaki mputa na balɔkɔ mpe akembiaki Ilako na bilembetelo biliki mbahema na balɔkɔ.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>